(290, 'About Institute', '', '<div class=\"container my-3\">\n<div class=\"row\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- Left side: Text -->\n<h2 class=\"section-title1\">An Introduction to The Institution</h2>\n<div class=\"col-lg-8 col-12\">\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">Bhagini Seva Mandir Kumarika Stree Mandal started Nootan Mahila College in 1972. With changing policies and social needs, it has grown into an institution that blends tradition with modern technology. Read more about our journey <a style=\"color: #3598db;\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/history\"><u>here.</u></a></p>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify mt-2\">The undergraduate and post-graduate sections of the college are currently known by the name of <strong>Maniben Nanavati Women&rsquo;s College</strong> and the junior college is known as <strong>Tapiben Chhaganlal Lalji Valia Junior College</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify mt-2\">Since its inception, the College has embraced a <strong>holistic approach </strong>to the <strong>development of women</strong> across <strong>all social and economic spheres.</strong> Its ultimate aim is to empower women to become healthy, productive, and capable individuals, while also achieving economic independence.It is affiliated with SNDT Women&rsquo;s University, Mumbai, which holds an all-India jurisdiction, and is not affiliated with Baroda or any other university. Over the course of more than three decades, the college has evolved into a distinguished educational institution, adeptly fulfilling its mission in both formal and extension education.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- Right Column for Image (Top Right) -->\n<div class=\"col-lg-4  image-col\">\n<div class=\"main-image-container\"><img src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/about-institute.jpg\" alt=\"Maniben Nanavati Women\'s College Campus\" />\n<div class=\"image-caption\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container \">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title1\">The Pathway</h2>\n<section class=\"about-section \">\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">Smt. Maniben Chandulal Nanavati is known by the epithet &ldquo;<strong>khadi Mata</strong>.&rdquo; A freedom fighter, she worked closely with Mahatma Gandhi during the Indian freedom movement and continued to follow his ideals and philosophy all along her life. Fondly known also as &ldquo;<strong>Mani Ba</strong>,&rdquo; she worked relentlessly for the upliftment of women and other marginalized sections of society. An empowered woman, in times when the term was still an unheard one, she dedicated her life to promote khadi and helps hundreds of women attain economic independence.</p>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify mt-2\">That the institution has derived its name from such an exemplary woman is a matter of great honor. Her high values and vision have been cherished by the institution till date and will continue to do so forever.</p>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify mt-2\">&ldquo;Empowerment of Women through Access to Higher Education,&rdquo; has been the mission statement of the College since its inception. Bhagini Seva Mandir Kumarika Stree Mandal <strong>(BSMKSM) </strong>started Nootan Mahila College in <strong>1972</strong>. The Foundation stone of BMSKMS was laid by Mahatma Gandhi. In <strong>1978,</strong> Shree Chandulal Nanavati Women&rsquo;s institute &amp; Girls&rsquo; High School took over the management of Nootan Mahila College and renamed it Maniben Nanavati Women&rsquo;s Colleges <strong>(MNWC)</strong>. In 1979, the College received permanent affiliation with SNDT Women&rsquo;s University, Mumbai.</p>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify mt-2\">MNWC bridges the past to present. Established with the vision of offering conventional academic programmes to the women from the close by vicinity, the College took major leaps time and again to match the pace with the needs of the changing world. Almost half a century back, women who were first generation college-goers ( and for that matter school, too) got the much desired opportunity here to step out of their domestic circuits and upgrade themselves in the areas of home-economics and socio-cultural dynamics. They were the silent sentinels preserving the rich culture and tradition of a great nation. Yet, in their own capacity and manner, they made their discreet contribution to the development of the nation.</p>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify mt-2\">At the turn of the century, as the global scenario changed, young women ushered into the new era of electronics, computers and digitalization. While still preserving the legacy of the rich Indian tradition, they took up the challenges of the changing modern India and contribute to be the equal partners in the progress of the nation. Proud to be affiliated to the centurion SNDT Women&rsquo;s University, the College has offered opportunities to women of more than three generations to become economically and socially self-sufficient.</p>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify mt-2\">Although a women&rsquo;s college, gender sensitization, development and empowerment are among the core values of the institution. Academics, research, employability skills, internship, placement ,entrepreneurship, community outreach projects, National Social scheme (NSS), National Cadet Corps (NCC), Youth Red Cross, Rotaract Club, Sports, Yoga, Value Education and various other programmes mould, shape and prepare young women at MNWC. So when they enter MNWC with thousands of dreams and aspirations to prove their worth in the world of rat race, after completing their education here, they step out with a gait of overbearing confidence, dignity and self-efficacy.</p>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'about-institute', 'user_defined', 0, 'About Institute', '', '', 'About Institute', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 235),
(291, 'History', '', '<div class=\"row mb-4\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title1\">HISTORY OF COLLEGE</h2>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Maniben Nanavati Women&rsquo;s College is the dream child of two dynamic and farsighted women &ndash; late Smt. Kantaben Shah (1916-1981) and late Smt. Sunitaben Sheth (1924-2012), the erstwhile Chairperson of the Managing Committee. Both of them hailed from aristocratic Guajarati business families fully devoted to the cause of welfare and upliftment of the community in their immediate surroundings. As active members of the Bhagini Seva Mandir Kumarika Stree Mandal (BSMKSM), Vile Parle West, Mumbai, both of them kept up to the main mission of the Mandal- the welfare and empowerment of women. The foundation stone of the BSMKSM was laid by Mahatma Gandhi, the beloved Bapu. Following the footsteps of Gandhiji&rsquo;s efforts in educating and empowering women, they started the Nootan Mahila College in 1972 under the aegis of BSMKSM with a small number of 110 students. In 1978, Shree Chandulal Nanavati Women&rsquo;s Institute and Girls&rsquo; High School, an educational trust took over the administration of the College and rechristened it with the present name.</p>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify mt-2\">With the introduction of the 10-2-3 system of education, a junior college was started in June 1976. It was named Tapiben Chhaganlal Lalji Valia Junior College in June 1979. The same year, the College received permanent affiliation from the SNDT Women&rsquo;s University, Mumbai. The college remains affiliated to the same University till date.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-4\" />\n<h2 class=\"section-title1\">Our Visionaries</h2>\n<div class=\"content-block mb-5\">\n<div class=\"row less-gap\">\n<div class=\"col-md-9 col-12\">\n<h5 class=\"title-subhead\">Smt. Kantaben Shah (1916 &ndash; 1981)</h5>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">The first <strong>Founder President </strong>of the Managing Committee of the College, she continued her assignment as the President till her death in 1981. A very dynamic, resourceful, farsighted, and disciplined woman, she used her good offices as Corporator and Member of the Legislative Assembly to raise funds and establish contacts that helped the College to flourish and grow well. Her leadership helped to establish strong foundations for the college.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-3 col-12 text-center\"><img class=\"principal-photo\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Smt.-Kantaben-Shah-(1916-&ndash;-1981).png\" alt=\"Smt. Kantaben Shah\" /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"content-block mb-5\">\n<div class=\"row  less-gap\">\n<div class=\"col-md-3 col-12 text-center\"><img class=\"principal-photo\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Smt.-Sunitaben-Sheth-(1924-2012).png\" alt=\"Smt. Sunitaben Sheth\" /></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9 col-12\">\n<h5 class=\"title-subhead\">Smt. Sunitaben Sheth (1924-2012)</h5>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">A religious minded person, she was an educationist who firmly believed in creating opportunities for women to grow. Her passion for establishing an institution for educating women and her collaborative efforts with Kantaben and Mandakiniben led to the formation of Maniben Nanavati Women&rsquo;s College. She nurtured teaching and non-teaching staff alike and students were always her priority. She was fond of reading and therefore took keen interest in setting up the college library. Her vision was not just <strong>academic excellence</strong>, but <strong>education</strong>, <strong>knowledge</strong> and values to<strong> help women</strong> become better homemakers, mothers, professionals and confident individuals.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"content-block mb-5\">\n<div class=\"row less-gap\">\n<div class=\"col-md-9 col-12\">\n<h5 class=\"title-subhead\">Shri. Jagdish Nanavati (1928&ndash;2011)</h5>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">Born to the philanthropic Nanavati Family, Jagdish, the eldest son of Chandulal Balabhai Nanavati, was a <strong>unique</strong> personality. Influenced by his mother Maniben Nanavati and Swami Anand, he had two major passions in life: philanthropy and nature. While meeting with the challenges of his first passion, he rose to the level of being the trustee of the family-run charitable organization at a very young age of 25. From member of the Trustee Board, he became the President of Dr. Balabhai Nanavati Hospital, Hon. Secretary of Chandulal Nanavati Women&rsquo;s Institute and Girl&rsquo;s High School, and President of Khadi Village Industries Association. He was also the President of Mumbai Upnagar Seva Mandal, a public charitable trust where Gandhian activities have been conducted for more than seven decades.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-3 col-12 text-center\"><img class=\"principal-photo\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Shri.-Jagdish-Nanavati-(1928-2011).png\" alt=\"Shri. Jagdish Nanavati (1928&ndash;2011)\" /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"content-block mb-5\">\n<div class=\"row  less-gap\"><!-- Left side image -->\n<div class=\"col-md-3 col-12 text-center\"><img class=\"principal-photo\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mrs.-Mandakini-J,-Nanavati-(1926-2015).png\" alt=\"Mrs. Mandakini J. Nanavati (1926&ndash;2015)\" /></div>\n<!-- Right side text -->\n<div class=\"col-md-9 col-12\">\n<h5 class=\"title-subhead\">Mrs. Mandakini J. Nanavati (1926&ndash;2015)</h5>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">Mandakiniben was an ardent follower of Gandhian principles. She was a social activist, academician, and tree lover who was actively involved with a number of social organizations that worked for the betterment of society. A graduate from the famous <strong>Elphinstone</strong> College in Mumbai, she, along with Ba, played an active role in the <strong>freedom</strong> movement and continued to be a strong advocate of swadeshi and gramodyog goods all her life. Khadi was like her second skin, and she remained actively involved with Gramodyog Centres such as Kora Kendra, Khadi Bhavan, and Mumbai Upnagar Seva Mandal. She was an environmentalist, a self-taught investor, and a visionary.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'history', 'user_defined', 0, 'History', '', '', 'History', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 2),
(292, 'Smt. Maniben - Our Role Model', '', '<section class=\"maniben-section container\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title1\">Smt. Maniben Chandulal Nanavati (1905-2000) &ndash; Our Role Model</h2>\n<div class=\"row\"><!-- Left side text -->\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">The spinning wheel is the textbook of my life.</h2>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">These words by Smt. Maniben Nanavati, fondly remembered as the beloved <strong>&lsquo;Mani Ba,</strong>&rsquo; was the wife of Shree Chandulal Nanavati. She was a close associate of Gandhiji. During her lifetime, she religiously followed and practiced the Gandhian principles of honesty, simplicity, dignity of labour and the need to give a meaningful and practical education to the students. It was this attribute of hers that led the College to tread steadily and steadfastly on the path of continuous progress and developmental growth. She was a promoter of khadi and an ardent spinner of khadi. She was given the epithet of &ldquo;Khadi Mata&rdquo;.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- First image -->\n<div class=\"col-md-3 text-center\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Smt.-Maniben-Chandulal-Nanavati-1.png\" data-lightbox=\"gallery\" data-title=\"Smt. Maniben Chandulal Nanavati\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail maniben-img\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Smt.-Maniben-Chandulal-Nanavati-1.png\" alt=\"Smt. Maniben Chandulal Nanavati Image 1\" /> </a></div>\n<!-- Second image -->\n<div class=\"col-md-3 text-center\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Smt.-Maniben-Chandulal-Nanavati-2.png\" data-lightbox=\"maniben-gallery\" data-title=\"Smt. Maniben Chandulal Nanavati - Image 2\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail maniben-img\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Smt.-Maniben-Chandulal-Nanavati-2.png\" alt=\"Smt. Maniben Chandulal Nanavati Image 2\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</section>', 'same_window', 'smt-maniben--our-role-model', 'user_defined', 0, 'Smt. Maniben -Our Role Model', '', '', 'Smt Maniben  Our Role Model', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 235),
(293, 'Milestones', '', '<div class=\"timeline\">\n<div class=\"milestone right\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>1972</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Nootan Mahila College started with 110 students ( Arts stream with Gujarati Medium)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone left1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>1976</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Started Jr. College (Arts &amp; Commerce).</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone right\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>1979</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>The college received permanent affiliation to S.N.D.T. Women&rsquo;s University for Arts faculty.</li>\n<li>Started the Commerce stream with English Medium.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone left1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>1982</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduced Home &ndash; Economics (Food &amp; Nutrition and Child Development) as Applied component.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone right\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>1999</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduced Vocational subject, Office Management &amp; Secretarial Practice for Commerce students.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone left1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2002</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Launching of &ldquo;Anveshan&rdquo;, the In-House Research Journal.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone right\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2004</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>College accredited &lsquo;B&rsquo; by NAAC.</li>\n<li>Introduced P.G. Courses: M.A. &ndash; Psychology Counseling &amp; M. Com &ndash; Human Resource Management.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone left1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2005</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduced Advertising as an ancillary subject for S.Y.B.Com students.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone right\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2006</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduces B.A. with English Literature as a Specialization.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone left1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2007</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Started Network Resource Centre.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone right\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2008</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduced Bachelor of Management Study (BMS).</li>\n<li>Installed Linguaphone system in the Language Laboratory.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone left1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2009</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>College Reaccredited with the &lsquo;B&rsquo; Grade (2.89 CGPA on a scale of 4)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone right\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2010</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Established Gandhian Studies Centre financed by UGC.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone left1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2011</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Started Post Graduate Diploma Course in Early Childhood Education</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone right\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2012</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>The college received permanent affiliation from S.N.D.T Women&rsquo;s University for M.Com. (HRM) programme &amp; B.Com- Office Mgmt. &amp; Sec. Practice</li>\n<li>Commencement of MA -Clinical Psychology programme</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone left1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2013</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Commencement of B.Com - Accounting, Finance &amp; Insurance - BAFI programme.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone right\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2014</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Started XI Commerce with Maths &amp; IT.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone left1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2015</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Research Horizons listed by EBSCO, USA.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone right\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2016</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>College Re-Accredited in 3rd Cycle with &lsquo;A&rsquo; grade by NAAC</li>\n<li>Mrs. Keyaa Mukherjee receives the Bharat Ratna Maharshi Karve Award</li>\n<li>Commencement of the M.Com - Advanced Management, Accounting and Auditing programme</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone left1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2017</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>MOU with Udayana University, Bali Indonesia.</li>\n<li>First Prize at the &ldquo;Avishkar&rdquo; State Level Research Convention.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone right\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2018</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>MoU with Global Hindi Foundation, Singapore</li>\n<li>MoU with Lincoln University, Malaysia</li>\n<li>SAS Institution India Pvt. Ltd. sponsored installation of Five Smart Classrooms</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone left1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2019</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Received Maharshi Karve Utkrushtha Mahila Vidyalaya Puraskar (BEST COLLEGE) 2018-2019</li>\n<li>Commencement of Bachelor in Fashion Design Programme</li>\n<li>Revival of UGC Sponsored Gandhian Study Centre</li>\n<li>MOU with Tata Institute of Social Sciences</li>\n<li>MOU with Shenzhen University, China</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone right\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2020</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Launch of Smt. Kantaben Shah Research Centre</li>\n<li>Listed in NIRF Participating Colleges</li>\n<li>ISO 9001 :2015 Certification</li>\n<li>Second Prize at AVISHKAR West Zone</li>\n<li>National E-Conference &amp; Webinar</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone left1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2021</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>NIRF Listing</li>\n<li>NSQF Courses</li>\n<li>Establishment of KSRC &amp; IIC</li>\n<li>Listing in ARIIA</li>\n<li>Commencement of Smt. Kantaben Shah Memorial Lecture</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone right\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2022</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Band Performer at ARIAA.</li>\n<li>IIC Registration.</li>\n<li>YATHA-KATHA Festival.</li>\n<li>REWA Conference.</li>\n<li>Introducing B.A.F.</li>\n<li>Best Teacher + Non-Teacher Award.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone left1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2023</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Renovation of college premises.</li>\n<li>Best Teacher Award.</li>\n<li>Swarna Kamal Golden Jubilee Celebration.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone right\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2024</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Best Course Award for CHETNA Course</li>\n<li>AICTE Approval.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"milestone left1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3>2025</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>NAAC Peer Team Visit for 4th Cycle Accreditation.</li>\n<li>3 Stars at Institutional Innovation Council (IIC)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'milestones', 'user_defined', 0, 'Milestones', '', '', 'Milestones', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 2),
(294, 'Objectives', '', '<div class=\"row align-items-start\"><!-- Left Column: 8 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-8 col-12\">\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul\">\n<li>To facilitate knowledge and skills to lead to economic empowerment of students.</li>\n<li>To encourage holistic development of students and staff members.</li>\n<li>To foster and develop ethically conscious and socially responsible citizens.</li>\n<li>To encourage financially and academically weaker students for taking up higher education.</li>\n<li>To provide opportunities and platform to adult learners.</li>\n<li>To sustain total quality management in academics and administration.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<!-- Right Column: 4 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 col-12 text-center\"><img class=\"img-fluid rounded\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Objectives.png\" alt=\"Objectives Image\" /></div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'objectives', 'user_defined', 0, 'Objectives', '', '', 'Objectives', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 237),
(295, 'Laboratories', '', '<div class=\"row unified-layout py-4\"><!-- Desktop Sidebar (Hidden on Mobile) -->\n<div class=\"col-lg-3 nav-pills-desktop\">\n<div id=\"v-pills-tab\" class=\"nav flex-column nav-pills\" role=\"tablist\"><button id=\"v-tab-computer\" class=\"nav-link active\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#pane-computer\">Computer Laboratory</button> <button id=\"v-tab-english\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#pane-english\">English Language Lab</button> <button id=\"v-tab-psychology\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#pane-psychology\">Psychology Laboratory</button> <button id=\"v-tab-food\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#pane-food\">Food &amp; Nutrition Lab</button> <button id=\"v-tab-textile\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#pane-textile\">Textile / Dying &amp; Printing Lab</button> <button id=\"v-tab-pattern\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#pane-pattern\">Pattern Making / Draping Lab</button> <button id=\"v-tab-art\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#pane-art\">Art Room / Design Lab</button> <button id=\"v-tab-construction\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#pane-construction\">Construction Lab</button></div>\n</div>\n<!-- Content Area (Shared Sidebar/Accordion) -->\n<div id=\"unified-accordion\" class=\"col-lg-9 tab-content accordion\"><!-- 1. Computer Laboratory -->\n<div id=\"pane-computer\" class=\"tab-pane fade show active accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseOne\"> Computer Laboratory </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseOne\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Computer Laboratory</h2>\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"lab-img-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/computer-lab-img.png\" data-lightbox=\"computer-lab\" data-title=\"Computer Laboratory 1\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/computer-lab-img.png\" alt=\"Computer Laboratory 1\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"lab-img-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/computer-lab-img2.png\" data-lightbox=\"computer-lab\" data-title=\"Computer Laboratory 2\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/computer-lab-img2.png\" alt=\"Computer Laboratory 2\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2. English Language Lab -->\n<div id=\"pane-english\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseTwo\"> English Language Lab </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseTwo\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">English Language Lab</h2>\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"lab-img-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/english-lab.png\" data-lightbox=\"English-lab\" data-title=\"English Laboratory\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/english-lab.png\" alt=\"English Laboratory\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 3. Psychology Laboratory -->\n<div id=\"pane-psychology\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseThree\"> Psychology Laboratory </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseThree\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Psychology Laboratory</h2>\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"lab-img-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/psychology-lab.jpeg\" data-lightbox=\"Psychology-lab\" data-title=\"Psychology Laboratory\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/psychology-lab.jpeg\" alt=\"Psychology Laboratory\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 4. Food & Nutrition Lab -->\n<div id=\"pane-food\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseFour\"> Food &amp; Nutrition Lab </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseFour\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Food &amp; Nutrition Lab</h2>\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"lab-img-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/food-lab.jpeg\" data-lightbox=\"food-lab\" data-title=\"Food Laboratory\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/food-lab.jpeg\" alt=\"Food Laboratory\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 5. Textile / Dying & Printing Lab -->\n<div id=\"pane-textile\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseFive\"> Textile / Dying &amp; Printing Lab </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseFive\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Textile / Dying &amp; Printing Lab</h2>\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"lab-img-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/printing-lab.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"Textile-lab\" data-title=\"Textile Laboratory\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/printing-lab.jpg\" alt=\"Textile Laboratory\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 6. Pattern Making / Draping Lab -->\n<div id=\"pane-pattern\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseSix\"> Pattern Making / Draping Lab </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseSix\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Pattern Making / Draping Lab</h2>\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"lab-img-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/drapping-lab.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"Pattern-lab\" data-title=\"Pattern Making Laboratory\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/drapping-lab.jpg\" alt=\"Pattern Making Laboratory\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 7. Art Room / Design Lab -->\n<div id=\"pane-art\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseSeven\"> Art Room / Design Lab </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseSeven\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Art Room / Design Lab</h2>\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"lab-img-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/design-lab.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"Art-lab\" data-title=\"Art Room Laboratory\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/design-lab.jpg\" alt=\"Art Room Laboratory\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 8. Construction Lab -->\n<div id=\"pane-construction\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseEight\"> Construction Lab </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseEight\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Construction Lab</h2>\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"lab-img-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Construction-Lab.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"Construction-lab\" data-title=\"Construction Laboratory\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Construction-Lab.jpg\" alt=\"Construction Laboratory\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'laboratories', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Laboratories', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 2),
(296, 'Management Body', '', '<!-- 1st Row - 1 Card in Center -->\n<h2 class=\"section-title1\">Managing Commitee</h2>\n<div class=\"row text-center justify-content-center\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"management-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3 mx-auto d-block\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mrs.Himadri-Nanavati.jpg\" />\n<p class=\"mb-1\"><strong>Smt. Himadri Nanavati</strong></p>\n<div class=\"chairperson-title\">Chairperson</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2nd Row - 3 Cards -->\n<div class=\"row text-center\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"management-card p-3 h-100\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3 mx-auto d-block\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Dr.-Mrs.-Yogini-Sheth.png\" />\n<p class=\"mb-1\"><strong>Dr. Mrs. Yogini Sheth</strong></p>\n<div class=\"chairperson-title\">Hon. Secretary</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"management-card p-3 h-100\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3 mx-auto d-block\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Shachin-Nanavati.png\" />\n<p class=\"mb-1\"><strong>Mr. Shachin Nanavati</strong></p>\n<div class=\"chairperson-title\">Hon. Treasurer</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"management-card p-3 h-100\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3 mx-auto d-block\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mrs.-Usha-Nanavati.png\" />\n<p class=\"mb-1\"><strong>Mrs. Usha Nanavati</strong></p>\n<div class=\"chairperson-title\">Hon. Jt. Secretary</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 3rd Row - 2 Cards -->\n<div class=\"row text-center justify-content-center\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"management-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3 mx-auto d-block\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Apurva-Nanavati.png\" />\n<p class=\"mb-1\"><strong>Mr. Apurva Nanavati</strong></p>\n<div class=\"chairperson-title\">Trustee</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"management-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3 mx-auto d-block\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mrs.-Parul-Choksey.png\" />\n<p class=\"mb-1\"><strong>Mrs. Parul Choksey</strong></p>\n<div class=\"chairperson-title\">Member</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"management-card p-3 h-100\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3 mx-auto d-block\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Prof.-Vibhuti-Patel.png\" />\n<p class=\"mb-1\"><strong>Prof. Vibhuti Patel</strong></p>\n<div class=\"chairperson-title\">Member</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 4th Row - 4 Cards -->\n<div class=\"row text-center\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"management-card p-3 h-100\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3 mx-auto d-block\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Prof.-Ancy-Jose.png\" />\n<p class=\"mb-1\"><strong>Prof. Ancy Jose</strong></p>\n<div class=\"chairperson-title\">Member</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"management-card p-3 h-100\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3 mx-auto d-block\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Adv.-Digish-Rawal.png\" />\n<p class=\"mb-1\"><strong>Adv. Digish Rawal</strong></p>\n<div class=\"chairperson-title\">Member</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"management-card p-3 h-100\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3 mx-auto d-block\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Dr.-Rajshree-Trivedi.png\" />\n<p class=\"mb-1\"><strong>Dr. Rajshree Trivedi</strong></p>\n<div class=\"chairperson-title\">Principal</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'management-body', 'user_defined', 0, 'Management Body', '', '', 'Management Body', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 235),
(297, 'Institutional Development Plan', '', '<div class=\"table-responsive text-center\">\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-striped table-head-style\" style=\"width: 100%; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<thead class=\"table-dark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-center\">Sr. No.</th>\n<th class=\"text-center\">Title</th>\n<th class=\"text-center\">Document</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-center\">1</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Institutional Development Plan 2023-24 To 2032-33</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Institutional-Development-Plan-2023-24-to-2032-33.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'institutional-development-plan', 'user_defined', 0, 'Institutional Development Plan', '', '', 'Institutional Development Plan', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 235),
