> Sweeper</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 07/10/2014</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-4\" />\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead mt-2\">Unaided Support Staff:</h2>\n<div class=\"row text-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Shraddha-Jagtap.png\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Shraddha Jagtap</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Lab Attendant</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 01/04/2006</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Vandana-Keni.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Vandana Keni</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Lab Attendant</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 01/09/2013</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Rajendra-Bane.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Rajendra Bane</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Peon</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 07/11/2005</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Jagdish-Jangale.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Jagdish Jangale</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Peon</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 02/08/2010</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Tulsa-Waghela.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Tulsa Waghela</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Sweeper</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 28/03/2012</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Manjula-Solanki.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Manjula Solanki</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Sweeper</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 01/09/2021</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Bhikaji-Gade.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Bhikaji Gade</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Peon cum Housekeeping</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 02/05/2023</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Bharati-Solanki.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Bharati Solanki</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Sweeper cum Housekeeping</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 19/05/2023</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Ravindra-Chogale.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Ravindra Chogale</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Peon</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 02/01/2024</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Pandharinath-Parab.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Pandharinath Parab</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Peon</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 15/03/2024</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-4\" />\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead mt-2\">BNCDC Support Staff:</h2>\n<div class=\"row text-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Suresh-Chaugule.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Suresh Chaugule</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Peon</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 01/04/1999</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Soniya-Mahida.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Soniya Mahida</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Peon cum Sweeper</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 01/01/2023</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 4: WORKING SECTION -->\n<div id=\"working\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseWorking\"> College Office Working </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseWorking\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body p-0 pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">College Office Working</h2>\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul inner-para text-justify my-0\">\n<li>The office is open daily from 9:00 AM to 4:00 PM &ndash; Monday to Saturday except Sundays and holidays.</li>\n<li>Office oversees day-to-day operations including facility management and communication between students, faculty, staff and other stakeholders.</li>\n<li>Students may refer complaints to the Head of the Admin Office.</li>\n<li>Courtesy is appreciated and welcomed.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 5: RESOURCES SECTION -->\n<div id=\"resources\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseResources\"> Resources and Equipment </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseResources\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body p-0 pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Resources and Equipment</h2>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul inner-para text-justify my-0\">\n<li>Number of computers: 20</li>\n<li>Laptops: 4</li>\n<li>Printers: 12</li>\n<li>Scanners: 3</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul inner-para text-justify my-0\">\n<li>Xerox machine: 1</li>\n<li>Paper shredders: 1</li>\n<li>Internet connectivity</li>\n<li>Fully Automated Office Management System</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 6: REPORTS SECTION -->\n<div id=\"reports\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseReports\"> Reports </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseReports\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body p-0 pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Reports</h2>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-striped table-head-style\">\n<thead class=\"table-dark\">\n<tr>\n<th>Sr. No.</th>\n<th class=\"text-start\">Title</th>\n<th class=\"text-center document-heading-width\">Document</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">1</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Admin Srishti 2023-2024</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Admin-Srishti-2023-2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Report</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">2</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Admin Srishti 2022-2023</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Admin-Srishti-2022-2023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Report</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">3</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Admin Srishti 2021-2022</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Admin-Srishti-2021-2022.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Report</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">