e vulnerable people and communities.</p>\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul\">\n<li>Protection of Health &amp; Life;</li>\n<li>Service to the Sick &amp; Suffering Promotion of National &amp; International Friendship;</li>\n<li>To develop the mental and moral capacities of the youth.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-3\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/youth-red-cross1.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"youthmob\" data-title=\"Beach Clean Drive\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/youth-red-cross1.jpg\" alt=\"Beach Clean Drive\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-3\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/youth-red-cross2.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"youthmob\" data-title=\"Station Painting\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/youth-red-cross2.jpg\" alt=\"Station Painting\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-3\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/youth-red-cross3.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"youthmob\" data-title=\"Elocution-Competition\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/youth-red-cross3.jpg\" alt=\"Elocution-Competition\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-3\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/youth-red-cross4.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"youthmob\" data-title=\"Pad-Distribution\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/youth-red-cross4.jpg\" alt=\"Pad-Distribution\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-3\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/youth-red-cross5.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"youthmob\" data-title=\"World-Red-Cross-day\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/youth-red-cross5.jpg\" alt=\"World-Red-Cross-day\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-3\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/youth-red-cross6.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"youthmob\" data-title=\"Blood Donation\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/youth-red-cross6.jpg\" alt=\"Blood Donation\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-3\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/youth-red-cross7.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"youthmob\" data-title=\"Talk-on-Menstruation\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/youth-red-cross7.jpg\" alt=\"Talk-on-Menstruation\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Rotaract Accordion Item -->\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"heading-rotaract\" class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapse-rotaract\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse-rotaract\"> Rotaract Club</button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapse-rotaract\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"heading-rotaract\" data-bs-parent=\"#nss-yrc-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"mb-4\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 mb-3\">\n<p><a class=\"btn-pdf w-100\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1765883080-ROTARACT-CLUB-OF-MANIBEN-NANAVATI-WOMEN.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Annual Report</span> </a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'nssyrc', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'NSSYRC', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 2),
(356, 'Sports/Yoga', '', '<div class=\"sports-yoga\"><!-- Desktop View - Left Tabs with Right Content -->\n<div class=\"d-none d-lg-block\">\n<div class=\"row\"><!-- Left Side - Tabs -->\n<div class=\"col-lg-3\">\n<div id=\"v-pills-tab\" class=\"nav flex-column nav-pills me-3\" role=\"tablist\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\"><button id=\"v-pills-sports-tab\" class=\"nav-link active\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#v-pills-sports\" aria-controls=\"v-pills-sports\" aria-selected=\"true\">Sports</button> <button id=\"v-pills-premier-tab\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#v-pills-premier\" aria-controls=\"v-pills-premier\" aria-selected=\"false\">MNWC Premier League</button> <button id=\"v-pills-yoga-tab\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#v-pills-yoga\" aria-controls=\"v-pills-yoga\" aria-selected=\"false\">Yoga</button></div>\n</div>\n<!-- Right Side - Content -->\n<div class=\"col-lg-9\">\n<div id=\"v-pills-tabContent\" class=\"tab-content\"><!-- Sports Content -->\n<div id=\"v-pills-sports\" class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"v-pills-sports-tab\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Sports</h2>\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">Maniben Nanavati Women\'s College has adequate facilities for sports activities for the students. Main focus remains on the fitness and training. College has appointed regular coaches for the games. Our students are trained in Fencing, Taekwondo, Boxing, Chess, Carrom, Rope Malkhamb, Table Tennis, Badminton, Handball, Cricket, Tug-of-war and athletics. Athletics students are sent to SAI (Sports Authority of India) ground for regular practice.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">In the recent years, Nanavati College has been a champion at University level in Rope Malkhamb, Cricket, Tug-of-war, Badminton, Handball, Boxing and Fencing. Students have played Boxing, Rope Malkhamb, Taekwondo, Fencing at the regional and national level.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">The College has a dedicated space for the sports activities. There is a Sports room, backyard area for practicing various sports, and a hall for conducting various activities and programs.The College provides sufficient sports infrastructure to the students for training and practicing various games. The following sports kits/equipment have been purchased for this purpose and maintained on regular basis:</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul text-justify inner-para\">\n<li>Table Tennis Table / Net / Rackets / Balls</li>\n<li>Taekwondo Uniforms</li>\n<li>Taekwondo Head Guards, Chest Guards</li>\n<li>Boxing Kit</li>\n<li>Cricket Kit</li>\n<li>Chess Boards and Coins</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul\">\n<li>Carom Boards and Coins</li>\n<li>Malkhamb Rope and Mats</li>\n<li>Badmintion Rackets and Shuttle Cocks</li>\n<li>Hand Balls</li>\n<li>Football</li>\n<li>Tug of war Rope</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411783-img1.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery\" data-title=\"MNWC Premier League\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411783-img1.jpg\" alt=\"MNWC Premier League\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/img2.png\" data-lightbox=\"gallery\" data-title=\"Annual Sports Day Long Jump\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/img2.png\" alt=\"Annual Sports Day Long Jump\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411783-img3.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery\" data-title=\"Tug-of-war ADHYA Sports meet for women\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411783-img3.jpg\" alt=\"Tug-of-war ADHYA Sports meet for women\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/img4.png\" data-lightbox=\"gallery\" data-title=\"Annual Sports day Running Race\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/img4.png\" alt=\"Annual Sports day Running Race\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411784-img5.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery\" data-title=\"Sakshi kashide- Ropemalkhamb\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411784-img5.jpg\" alt=\"Sakshi kashide- Ropemalkhamb\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img6.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery\" data-title=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img6.jpg\" alt=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img7.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery\" data-title=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img7.jpg\" alt=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img8.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery\" data-title=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img8.jpg\" alt=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img9.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery\" data-title=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img9.jpg\" alt=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Premier League Content -->\n<div id=\"v-pills-premier\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"v-pills-premier-tab\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">MNWC Premier League</h2>\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\"><a class=\" btn-pdf w-100 \" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1765883813-MNWC-Premier-League_20240201_065729_0000.pdf\" target=\"_blank \"><span class=\"btn-text\">Underarm Cricket Tournament</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Yoga Content -->\n<div id=\"v-pills-yoga\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"v-pills-yoga-tab\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Yoga</h2>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">Maniben Nanavati Women\'s College, under Project NIRMMA, introduced YOGA for all the First Year Students. The volunteers YOGA PRABHA BHARATI (SEVA SANSTHA) conducts Samarpan Meditation and Yoga classes twice a week since January 2018.</p>\n<div class=\"row mt-2\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Breathing-Exercise-YOGA-500x350.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery1\" data-title=\"Breathing Exercise YOGA\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Breathing-Exercise-YOGA-500x350.jpg\" alt=\"Breathing Exercise YOGA\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Exercise-for-muscle-relaxation-yoga-500x350.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery1\" data-title=\"Exercise for muscle relaxation- yoga\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Exercise-for-muscle-relaxation-yoga-500x350.jpg\" alt=\"Exercise for muscle relaxation- yoga\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"ccol-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Yoga-for-Fy-Students_-1024x576.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery1\" data-title=\"Yoga for Fy Students\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Yoga-for-Fy-Students_-500x350.jpg\" alt=\"Yoga for Fy Students\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-3\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Yoga-for-FYBCOM--500x350.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery1\" data-title=\"Yoga for FYBCOM\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Yoga-for-FYBCOM--500x350.jpg\" alt=\"Yoga for FYBCOM\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/yoga-warmup-500x350.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery1\" data-title=\"yoga -warmup\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/yoga-warmup-500x350.jpg\" alt=\"yoga -warmup\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Yoga-500x350.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery1\" data-title=\"Yoga\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Yoga-500x350.jpg\" alt=\"Yoga\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!------------------------------ Mobile View - Accordion ----------------->\n<div class=\"d-lg-none\">\n<div id=\"mobileAccordion\" class=\"accordion\"><!-- Sports Accordion Item -->\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"mobileSportsHeading\" class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#mobileSports\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"mobileSports\"> Sports </button></h2>\n<div id=\"mobileSports\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" aria-labelledby=\"mobileSportsHeading\" data-bs-parent=\"#mobileAccordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">Maniben Nanavati Women\'s College has adequate facilities for sports activities for the students. Main focus remains on the fitness and training. College has appointed regular coaches for the games. Our students are trained in Fencing, Taekwondo, Boxing, Chess, Carrom, Rope Malkhamb, Table Tennis, Badminton, Handball, Cricket, Tug-of-war and athletics. Athletics students are sent to SAI (Sports Authority of India) ground for regular practice.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">In the recent years, Nanavati College has been a champion at University level in Rope Malkhamb, Cricket, Tug-of-war, Badminton, Handball, Boxing and Fencing. Students have played Boxing, Rope Malkhamb, Taekwondo, Fencing at the regional and national level.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">The College has a dedicated space for the sports activities. There is a Sports room, backyard area for practicing various sports, and a hall for conducting various activities and programs.The College provides sufficient sports infrastructure to the students for training and practicing various games. The following sports kits/equipment have been purchased for this purpose and maintained on regular basis:</p>\n<div class=\"row mt-3\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul\">\n<li>Table Tennis Table / Net / Rackets / Balls</li>\n<li>Taekwondo Uniforms</li>\n<li>Taekwondo Head Guards, Chest Guards</li>\n<li>Boxing Kit</li>\n<li>Cricket Kit</li>\n<li>Chess Boards and Coins</li>\n<li>Carom Boards and Coins</li>\n<li>Malkhamb Rope and Mats</li>\n<li>Badmintion Rackets and Shuttle Cocks</li>\n<li>Hand Balls</li>\n<li>Football</li>\n<li>Tug of war Rope</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411783-img1.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery 2\" data-title=\"MNWC Premier League\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411783-img1.jpg\" alt=\"MNWC Premier League\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/img2.png\" data-lightbox=\"gallery 2\" data-title=\"Annual Sports Day Long Jump\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/img2.png\" alt=\"Annual Sports Day Long Jump\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411783-img3.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery 2\" data-title=\"Tug-of-war ADHYA Sports meet for women\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411783-img3.jpg\" alt=\"Tug-of-war ADHYA Sports meet for women\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/img4.png\" data-lightbox=\"gallery2\" data-title=\"Annual Sports day Running Race\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/img4.png\" alt=\"Annual Sports day Running Race\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411784-img5.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery 2\" data-title=\"Sakshi kashide- Ropemalkhamb\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411784-img5.jpg\" alt=\"Sakshi kashide- Ropemalkhamb\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img6.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery 2\" data-title=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img6.jpg\" alt=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img7.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery 2\" data-title=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img7.jpg\" alt=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img8.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery 2\" data-title=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img8.jpg\" alt=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img9.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"gallery 2\" data-title=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1761411793-img9.jpg\" alt=\"Adhya Sports meet Chess competition\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Premier League Accordion Item -->\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"mobilePremierHeading\" class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#mobilePremier\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobilePremier\"> MNWC Premier League </button></h2>\n<div id=\"mobilePremier\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"mobilePremierHeading\" data-bs-parent=\"#mobileAccordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3\"><a class=\" btn-pdf w-100 \" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1765883813-MNWC-Premier-League_20240201_065729_0000.pdf\" target=\"_blank \"><span class=\"btn-text\">Underarm Cricket Tournament</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Yoga Accordion Item -->\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"mobileYogaHeading\" class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button \" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#mobileYoga\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobileYoga\"> Yoga </button></h2>\n<div id=\"mobileYoga\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"mobileYogaHeading\" data-bs-parent=\"#mobileAccordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">Maniben Nanavati Women\'s College, under Project NIRMMA, introduced YOGA for all the First Year Students . The volunteers YOGA PRABHA BHARATI (SEVA SANSTHA) conducts Samarpan Meditation and Yoga classes twice a week since January 2018.</p>\n<div class=\"row mt-2\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2 \"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Breathing-Exercise-YOGA-500x350.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"yoga mobile\" data-title=\"Breathing Exercise YOGA \"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Breathing-Exercise-YOGA-500x350.jpg\" alt=\"Breathing Exercise YOGA \" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2 \"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Exercise-for-muscle-relaxation-yoga-500x350.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"yoga mobile\" data-title=\"Exercise for muscle relaxation- yoga\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail \" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Exercise-for-muscle-relaxation-yoga-500x350.jpg\" alt=\"Exercise for muscle relaxation- yoga \" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2 \"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Yoga-for-Fy-Students_-1024x576.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"yoga mobile\" data-title=\"Yoga for Fy Students\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail \" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Yoga-for-Fy-Students_-500x350.jpg\" alt=\"Yoga for Fy Students \" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2 \"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Yoga-for-FYBCOM--500x350.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"yoga mobile\" data-title=\"Yoga for FYBCOM \"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Yoga-for-FYBCOM--500x350.jpg\" alt=\"Yoga for FYBCOM \" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2 \"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/yoga-warmup-500x350.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"yoga mobile\" data-title=\"yoga -warmup\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail \" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/yoga-warmup-500x350.jpg\" alt=\"yoga -warmup \" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-12 mb-2 \"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Yoga-500x350.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"yoga mobile\" data-title=\"Yoga\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail \" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Yoga-500x350.jpg\" alt=\"Yoga \" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'sportsyoga', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'SportsYoga', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 279),
(357, 'Directories', '', '<div class=\"Directories\">\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-striped table-head-style\">\n<thead class=\"text-center\">\n<tr class=\"table-dark\">\n<th class=\"serial-width\" style=\"text-align: right;\">Sr. No.</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Name</th>\n<th>View</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"text-center\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">SUMNAA UG &amp; PG &ndash; 2021-2022</td>\n<td><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/1MNAA-2021-22.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">SUMNAA UG &ndash; 2020-2021</td>\n<td><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/2Su-MNAA-Directory-2020-21-UG.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">3</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">SUMNAA PG &ndash; 2020-2021</td>\n<td><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/3Su-MNAA-Directory-2020-21-PG.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">4</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">SUMNAA UG &ndash; 2019-2020</td>\n<td><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/4MNAA-UG-2020.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">5</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">SUMNAA PG &ndash; 2019-2020</td>\n<td><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/5MNAA_MA_MCOM_2020_compressed.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'directories', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Directories', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 279);
INSERT INTO `tbl_master_pages` (`tmp_id`, `tmp_pane_name`, `tmp_new_page_content`, `tmp_page_content`, `tmp_menu_target`, `tmp_menu_link`, `tmp_page_type`, `page_group_id`, `tmp_meta_title`, `tmp_meta_description`, `tmp_meta_keywords`, `tmp_page_title`, `tmp_col_width`, `tmp_page_menu_type_bit`, `approve_bit`, `rejected_reason`, `tmp_added_date`, `user_id`) VALUES
(358, 'Membership Form', '', '<div class=\"membership-form\">\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<div class=\"text-center mb-2\">\n<h5 class=\"mb-2\">MANIBEN NANAVATI ALUMNI ASSOCIATION (MNAA)</h5>\n<h5 class=\"mb-2\">Membership Form</h5>\n<p class=\"fw-bold\">Registration no. 1387 /2019</p>\n</div>\n<form action=\"#\" method=\"post\"><!-- Hidden fields --> <input name=\"_wpcf7\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"2637\" /> <input name=\"_wpcf7_version\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"6.0\" /> <input name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"en_US\" /> <input name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"wpcf7-f2637-p2638-o1\" /> <input name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"2638\" /> <input name=\"_wpcf7_posted_data_hash\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\" /> <!-- Photo Upload -->\n<div class=\"row mb-2\">\n<div class=\"col-12\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"upload-photo\">Upload your Photo:</label> <input id=\"upload-photo\" class=\"form-control\" accept=\"audio/*,video/*,image/*\" name=\"photo\" type=\"file\" /></div>\n</div>\n<!-- Name and Address -->\n<div class=\"row mb-2\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-2\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"name\">Name:</label> <input class=\"form-control\" maxlength=\"400\" name=\"your-name\" required=\"\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Name\" /></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-2\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"address\">Address:</label> <textarea id=\"address\" class=\"form-control\" maxlength=\"2000\" name=\"address\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Address\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<!-- DOB and Year of Passing -->\n<div class=\"row mb-2\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-2\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"dob\">Date Of Birth:</label> <input id=\"dob\" class=\"form-control\" name=\"dob\" type=\"date\" placeholder=\"Date Of Birth\" /></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-2\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"yop\">Batch/Year Of Passing:</label> <input id=\"yop\" class=\"form-control\" maxlength=\"400\" name=\"yop\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Batch/Year of Passing\" /></div>\n</div>\n<!-- Contact and Section -->\n<div class=\"row mb-2\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-2\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"contact\">Contact No.:</label> <input id=\"contact\" class=\"form-control\" maxlength=\"10\" name=\"contactno\" type=\"tel\" placeholder=\"Contact No.\" /></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-2\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"section\">Section:</label><select id=\"section\" class=\"form-select\" name=\"section\">\n<option value=\"UG\">UG</option>\n<option value=\"Arts\">Arts</option>\n<option value=\"BMS\">BMS</option>\n<option value=\"B.Com AFI\">B.Com AFI</option>\n<option value=\"B. Design\">B. Design</option>\n<option value=\"M.A.\">M.A.</option>\n<option value=\"M.Com\">M.Com</option>\n</select></div>\n</div>\n<!-- Qualification and Working Status -->\n<div class=\"row mb-2\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-2\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"additional-qualification\">Additional Qualification:</label> <input id=\"additional-qualification\" class=\"form-control\" maxlength=\"400 \" name=\"aqualification \" required=\"\" type=\"text \" placeholder=\"Additional Qualification \" /></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-2\"><label class=\"form-label\">Are you Currently Working?</label>\n<div class=\"form-check \"><input id=\"currentworkyes\" class=\"form-check-input\" checked=\"checked\" name=\"currentlyworking\" type=\"radio\" value=\"Yes\" /> <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"currentworkyes\">Yes</label></div>\n<div class=\"form-check\"><input id=\"currentworkno\" class=\"form-check-input\" name=\"currentlyworking\" type=\"radio\" value=\"No\" /> <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"currentworkno\">No</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2 \"><input class=\"form-control\" maxlength=\"400 \" name=\"currentworkyes \" type=\"text \" placeholder=\"If Yes, \" /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Position and Working Since -->\n<div class=\"row mb-2 \">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-2 \"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"positionheld\">Position Held:</label> <input id=\"positionheld\" class=\"form-control\" maxlength=\"400\" name=\"positionheld\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Position Held\" /></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-2 \"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"workingsince\">Working Since:</label> <input id=\"workingsince\" class=\"form-control\" maxlength=\"400 \" name=\"workingsince\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Working Since\" /></div>\n</div>\n<!-- Alumni Participation and Awards -->\n<div class=\"row mb-2\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-2\"><label class=\"form-label\">Have you participated in any Alumni Meet as of now?</label>\n<div class=\"form-check\"><input id=\"alumniYes\" class=\"form-check-input\" checked=\"checked\" name=\"participatealumnis\" type=\"radio\" value=\"Yes\" /> <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"alumniYes\">Yes</label></div>\n<div class=\"form-check\"><input id=\"alumniNo\" class=\"form-check-input\" name=\"participatealumnis\" type=\"radio\" value=\"No\" /> <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"alumniNo\">No</label></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb23 \"><label class=\"form-label \">Awards/Medals/other achievements:</label>\n<div class=\"form-check \"><input id=\"duringcollege\" class=\"form-check-input\" checked=\"checked\" name=\"awards\" type=\"radio\" value=\"During college\" /> <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"duringcollege\">During college</label></div>\n<div class=\"form-check \"><input id=\"aftergraduation\" class=\"form-check-input\" name=\"awards\" type=\"radio\" /> <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"aftergraduation\">After Graduation</label></div>\n<div class=\"form-check \"><input id=\"both\" class=\"form-check-input\" name=\"awards\" type=\"radio\" value=\"Both\" /> <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"both\">Both</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2 \"><input class=\"form-control \" maxlength=\"400 \" name=\"duringcollege \" type=\"text \" placeholder=\"During College \" /></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2 \"><input class=\"form-control \" maxlength=\"400 \" name=\"aftergraduation \" type=\"text \" placeholder=\"After Graduation \" /></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2 \"><input class=\"form-control \" maxlength=\"400 \" name=\"both \" type=\"text \" placeholder=\"During College &amp; After Graduation \" /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Contribution and Signature -->\n<div class=\"row mb-2\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-2\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"contribute\">How you can contribute to College?</label> <textarea id=\"contribute\" class=\"form-control\" maxlength=\"2000\" name=\"address \" rows=\"2 \" placeholder=\"How you can contribute to College? \"></textarea></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-2\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"signature\">Signature:</label> <input id=\"signature\" class=\"form-control\" accept=\"audio/*,video/*,image/* \" name=\"signature \" type=\"file \" /></div>\n</div>\n<!-- Submit Button -->\n<div class=\"row \">\n<div class=\"col-12 text-center\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline-dark\" type=\"submit \">Send message</button></div>\n</div>\n</form></div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'membership-form', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Membership Form', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 236),
(359, 'Accessibility Guideline', '', '<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3\"><a class=\"btn-pdf w-100\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Guidelines-Accessibility-Guidelines-and-Standards-for-Higher-Education-Institutions-and-Universities.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <span class=\"btn-text\">Accessibilty Guideline</span></a></div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'accessibility-guideline', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Accessibility Guideline', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 2),
(360, 'Student Grievance Redressal Cell', '', '<div class=\"Student-grievance-redressel-cell\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<div class=\"mb-2\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title\">Student Grievance Redressal Committees (SGRC):</h5>\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">In compliance with the <strong>University Grants Commission (Redressal of Grievances of Students) Regulations, 2023</strong>, the Grievance Redressal Cell (GRC) has been established at Maniben Nanavati Women\'s College to ensure the effective resolution of student grievances in a transparent, fair, and timely manner.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\">\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead mt-2\">Objectives:</h2>\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul inner-para text-justify\">\n<li class=\" \">To provide a platform for students to raise academic and non-academic grievances.</li>\n<li class=\"\">To promote a responsive and accountable institutional framework.</li>\n<li>To address complaints relating to admissions, examinations, teaching, infrastructure, harassment, discrimination, and other student-related concerns.</li>\n<li class=\"\">To safeguard the dignity and rights of students as per UGC norms.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\">\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead mt-2\">Grievance Categories Covered:</h2>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 d-lg-block d-none\">\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul inner-para text-justify\">\n<li>Admission-related grievances</li>\n<li>Delay in exams or declaration of results</li>\n<li>Harassment or unfair treatment by faculty/staff</li>\n<li>Infrastructure and learning resources</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 d-lg-block d-none\">\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul inner-para text-justify\">\n<li>Discrimination on the basis of caste, disability, etc.</li>\n<li>Refusal of documents (e.g., certificates, mark sheets)</li>\n<li>Ragging (to be dealt with by the Anti-Ragging Committee if applicable)</li>\n<li>Other academic, administrative, or personal issues</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-12 d-lg-none d-block\">\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul inner-para text-justify\">\n<li>Admission-related grievances</li>\n<li>Delay in exams or declaration of results</li>\n<li>Harassment or unfair treatment by faculty/staff</li>\n<li>Infrastructure and learning resources</li>\n<li>Discrimination on the basis of caste, disability, etc.</li>\n<li>Refusal of documents (e.g., certificates, mark sheets)</li>\n<li>Ragging (to be dealt with by the Anti-Ragging Committee if applicable)</li>\n<li>Other academic, administrative, or personal issues</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\">\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead mt-2\">Grievance Redressal Mechanism:</h2>\n<ul class=\"styled-ol\">\n<li class=\"\">\n<p class=\"text-justify  inner-para\">Students can submit their grievances via: Student Grievance Redressal Box (placed on campus) Online portal</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<p class=\" text-justify inner-para\">The Student Grievance Redressal will acknowledge the grievance within <strong>3 working days</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">The committee will review and resolve the matter within <strong>15 working days</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para \">If the grievance is not resolved satisfactorily, students may appeal to the <strong>University-level Grievance Redressal Committee</strong> or the <strong>UGC Student Grievance Portal</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #3598db;\"><a class=\"text-decoration-underline \" style=\"color: #3598db; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://www.ugc.ac.in/grievance/\" target=\"_blank \">(https://www.ugc.ac.in/grievance/).</a></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-1 \">\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead mt-2\">Confidentiality and Non-Retaliation:</h2>\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul inner-para text-justify\">\n<li class=\"\">All grievances will be treated with confidentiality.</li>\n<li class=\"\">No student will face any retaliation for filing a grievance in good faith.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-3 \">\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead mt-2\">Composition:</h2>\n<div class=\"table-responsive \">\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-striped table-head-style \">\n<thead class=\"text-center \">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"serial-width\" style=\"width: 76px; text-align: right !important;\">Sr. No.</th>\n<th class=\"text-start\" scope=\"col\">Designation</th>\n<th class=\"text-start\" scope=\"col\">Name</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"text-center\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\" style=\"width: 76px; text-align: right !important;\">1</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Chairperson SGRC</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Dr. Rajshree Trivedi</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end align-middle\" style=\"width: 76px; text-align: right !important;\" rowspan=\"4\">2</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle text-start\" rowspan=\"4\">Faculty Member</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Dr. Twinkle Sanghavi</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-start\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Dr. Cicilia Chattier</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-start\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Ms. Shama Chavan</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-start\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Dr. Prerna Ramteke</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\" style=\"width: 76px; text-align: right !important;\">3</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Student Representative</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Ms. Lavina Waghela</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\" style=\"width: 76px; text-align: right !important;\">4</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Special Invitee</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Ms. Palak Shah</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\" style=\"width: 76px; text-align: right !important;\">5</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Non-Teaching Member</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Ms. Keyaa Mukherjee</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\" style=\"width: 76px; text-align: right !important;\">6</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Ombudsperson</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Prof. Rita Patil</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'student-grievance-redressal-cell', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Student Grievance Redressal Cell', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 235),
(361, 'Research and Development Cell', '', '<div class=\"Research-and-Development-Cell-(RDC):\">\n<div class=\"p-2\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title mt-3\">Introduction:</h5>\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">In line with the UGC Guidelines for the Establishment of Research and Development Cell in Higher Education Institutions (2022), Maniben Nanavati Women&rsquo;s College has established a Research and Development Cell (RDC) to promote quality research culture and innovation ecosystem within the institution. The RDC aims to foster a vibrant and collaborative research environment among faculty, students, and external stakeholders.</p>\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead mt-2\">Vision:</h2>\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">To put in place a robust mechanism for developing and strengthening the research ecosystem within HEIs, aligned with the provisions of NEP-2020.</p>\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead mt-2\">Mission:</h2>\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul my-0\">\n<li class=\"inner-para text-justify\">To create a conducive environment for enhanced research productivity.</li>\n<li class=\"inner-para text-justify\">To encourage collaboration across industry, government, community- based organizations, and agencies at the local, national, and international levels.</li>\n<li class=\"inner-para text-justify\">To facilitate greater access to research through mobilization of resources and funding.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"row\"><!-- left Column -->\n<div class=\"col-12 mb-1\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead mt-2\">Objectives:</h2>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">To create an organizational structure with role-based functions of RDC, formulate Research Policy for the HEIs, identify thrust areas of research, and form related cluster groups/ frontline teams/consortia of researchers.</p>\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul my-0\">\n<li class=\"text-justify inner-para\">To create enabling provisions in Research Policies for recruitment of research personnel, procurement of equipment, and financial management with adequate autonomy to the Principal Investigator(s) and disseminate research outcomes to stakeholders and the public at large.</li>\n<li class=\"text-justify inner-para\">To establish a special purpose vehicle to promote researchers and innovators, identify potential collaborators from industry, research organizations, academic institutions &amp; other stakeholders for cooperation and synergistic partnerships.</li>\n<li class=\"text-justify inner-para\">To act as a liaison between researchers &amp; relevant research funding agencies, extend guidance in preparation &amp; submission of project proposals and post-sanctioning of the grants to oversee adherence to timelines.</li>\n<li class=\"text-justify inner-para\">To have better coordination among other cells/centers dealing with University- Industry Inter Linkage, Incubation, Innovation and Entrepreneurship Development and Intellectual Property Rights (IPR).</li>\n<li class=\"text-justify inner-para\">To develop an Institutional Research Information System for sharing the status of ongoing/ completed research projects/Programmes, expertise &amp; resources, etc., making effective use of Information &amp; Communication Technology (ICT) for preparing the database of in-house experts to provide industrial consultancy and services.</li>\n<li class=\"text-justify inner-para\">To engage &amp; utilize the services of superannuated active faculty/scientists in research capacity building of talented young minds and promote mobility of researchers across institutions and R&amp;D Labs.</li>\n<li class=\"text-justify inner-para\">To serve as nodal centre for ideation and conceptualization of research topics/themes by organizing workshops and training programs and ensuring the integrity and ethical practices in research activities including clearance of bioethical committee wherever required.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Right Column: -->\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title mt-3\">Functions of the R&amp;D Cell :</h5>\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul inner-para text-justify my-0\">\n<li>Drafting and revising research policies (ethics, plagiarism, IPR, etc.)</li>\n<li>Encouraging faculty to pursue PhDs and funded projects.</li>\n<li>Organizing seminars, workshops, and conferences.</li>\n<li>Facilitating MOUs and collaborations for research.</li>\n<li>Supporting start-ups, incubations, and innovation labs.</li>\n<li>Monitoring research progress and reporting achievements.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h5 class=\"section-title mt-3\">Composition:</h5>\n<div class=\"table-responsive \">\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-striped table-head-style \">\n<thead class=\"text-center \">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"serial-width\">Sr. No.</th>\n<th class=\"text-start\" scope=\"col \">Designation</th>\n<th class=\"text-start\" scope=\"col \">Name</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"text-center \">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">1</td>\n<td class=\"text-start \">Principal</td>\n<td class=\"text-start \"><strong>Dr. Rajshree Trivedi </strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">2</td>\n<td class=\"text-start \">IQAC Coordinator</td>\n<td class=\"text-start \"><strong>Dr. Anuja Deshpande</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">3</td>\n<td class=\" text-start \">Research &amp; Development Cell Head</td>\n<td class=\"text-start \"><strong>Dr. Cicilia Chettiar </strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end align-middle\" rowspan=\"3\">4</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle text-start \" rowspan=\"3\">RDC Members</td>\n<td class=\"text-start \"><strong>Dr. Twinkle Sanghavi</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-start \"><strong>Dr. Swati Partani</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-start \"><strong>Dr. Rekha Kaklotar</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h5 class=\"section-title mt-3\">Peer Review Panel: Research Horizon</h5>\n<div class=\"table-responsive \">\n<table class=\"table table-bordered tabled-striped table-head-style \">\n<thead class=\"text-center \">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"serial-width\">Sr. No</th>\n<th class=\"text-start\">Name</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">1</td>\n<td class=\"fw-bold \">Dr. Poornima Madhavan</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">2</td>\n<td class=\"fw-bold \">Prof. Sitanshu Yashaschandra</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">3</td>\n<td class=\"fw-bold \">Dr. Anita Kapoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">4</td>\n<td class=\"fw-bold \">Dr. Usha Thakkar</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">5</td>\n<td class=\"fw-bold \">Prof. Justin Paul</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">6</td>\n<td class=\"fw-bold \">Dr. Manjusha Molwane Penn Kemp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">7</td>\n<td class=\"fw-bold \">Dr. Rupalee Burke</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">8</td>\n<td class=\"fw-bold \">Prof. Alice Clark</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">9</td>\n<td class=\"fw-bold \">Prof. S. John Michael Raj</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">10</td>\n<td class=\"fw-bold \">Dr. Jaya Earnest</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">11</td>\n<td class=\"fw-bold \">Prof. Kaushalnath Upadhyay</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">12</td>\n<td class=\"fw-bold \">Prof. Hanna Westberg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">13</td>\n<td class=\"fw-bold \">Dr. Chandrika Raval</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">14</td>\n<td class=\"fw-bold \">Dr. Saoko Funada</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'research-and-development-cell', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Research and Development Cell', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 2),
(362, 'Equal Opportunity Cell', '', '<div class=\"equal-opportunity-cell\">\n<div class=\"p-2\">\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para \">The Equal Opportunity Cell at Maniben Nanavati Women\'s College functions in line with the vision and framework laid down by the UGC Guidelines for Equal Opportunity Cells in Colleges and Universities with the principles of <span class=\"fw-bold\">equity, inclusion, and access</span> in higher education.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">We strive to develop a just, fair, and academically enriching environment for all. The cell is committed to ensuring that every student, irrespective of their caste, creed, religion, language, ethnicity, gender, ability status, or socio-economic background, is provided with an environment that fosters equal growth and opportunity.</p>\n<h5 class=\"section-title mt-3\">Aims and Objectives:</h5>\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul my-0\">\n<li class=\"text-justify\">To oversee the effective implementation of policies and programmes for disadvantaged groups.</li>\n<li class=\"text-justify\">To provide guidance and counselling with respect to academic, financial, social and other matters and to enhance the diversity within the campus.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<div class=\"equal-opportunity-card\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title mt-3\">Function:</h5>\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul my-0\">\n<li class=\"inner-para text-justify \">To ensure equity and equal opportunity to the community at large in the college and bring about social inclusion.</li>\n<li class=\" text-justify  inner-para\">To enhance the diversity among the students, teaching and non-teaching staff population and at the same time eliminate the perception of discrimination.</li>\n<li class=\" text-justify inner-para\">To create a socially congenial atmosphere for academic interaction and for the growth of healthy interpersonal relationships among the students coming from various social backgrounds.</li>\n<li class=\" text-justify   inner-para\">To make efforts to sensitize the academic community regarding the problems associated with social exclusion as well as aspirations of the marginalized communities.</li>\n<li class=\" text-justify inner-para\">To help individuals or a group of students belonging to the disadvantaged section of society to contain the problems related to discrimination.</li>\n<li class=\" text-justify  inner-para  \">To look into the grievances of the weaker section of society and suggest amicable solution to their problems.</li>\n<li class=\" text-justify  inner-para  \">To disseminate the information related to schemes and programmes for the welfare of the socially weaker section as well as notifications/memoranda, office orders of the Government, or other related agencies/organizations issued from time to time.</li>\n<li class=\" text-justify  inner-para  \">To prepare barrier free formalities/procedures for admission/ registration of students belonging to the disadvantaged groups of society.</li>\n<li class=\" text-justify  inner-para  \">To establish coordination with the Government and other agencies/organizations to mobilize academic and financial resources to provide assistance to students of the disadvantaged groups.</li>\n<li class=\" text-justify  inner-para  \">To organize periodic meetings to monitor the progress of different schemes.</li>\n<li class=\" text-justify  inner-para  \">To adopt measures to ensure due share of utilization by SC/ST in admissions, recruitments (teaching and non-teaching posts) and to improve their performances.</li>\n<li class=\"text-justify inner-para\">To sensitize the college on the problems of SC/ST and other disadvantaged groups.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'equal-opportunity-cell', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Equal Opportunity Cell', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 2),
(363, 'Socio Economically Disadvantaged Groups Cell', '', '<div class=\"Socio-Economically-Disadvantaged-Group-Cell\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">The Socio-Economically Disadvantaged Group Cell (SEDGC) is responsible for providing academic, financial and counselling support to disadvantaged students, facilitating their integration and success in the college. It also ensures compliance with UGC guidelines by organizing awareness programmes, monitoring student progress and addressing their grievances to foster an inclusive campus environment regardless of their socio-economic backgrounds. The cell functions as a dedicated support system to ensure that students from underprivileged sections of society can thrive academically, socially, and personally.</p>\n<h5 class=\"section-title mt-2\">Target Groups</h5>\n<ul class=\"px-0 unstyled-ul\">\n<li class=\"mb-1  text-justify list-unstyled\">Scheduled Castes (SC)</li>\n<li class=\"mb-1  text-justify list-unstyled\">Scheduled Tribes (ST)</li>\n<li class=\"mb-1 text-justify list-unstyled\">Other Backward Classes (OBC)</li>\n<li class=\"mb-1  text-justify list-unstyled\">Economically Weaker Sections (EWS)</li>\n<li class=\"mb-1  text-justify list-unstyled\">Religious minorities &amp; Linguistic Minorities</li>\n<li class=\"mb-1  text-justify list-unstyled\">Persons with Disabilities (PwDs)</li>\n<li class=\"mb-1 text-justify list-unstyled\">First-generation learners</li>\n<li class=\"mb-1 text-justify list-unstyled\">Migrant and rural students &amp; North East States</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"sedgsAccordion\" class=\"accordion\"><!-- Objectives Accordion Item -->\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"headingObjectives\" class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseObjectives\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"collapseObjectives\"> Objectives of SEDGs Cell: </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseObjectives\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" aria-labelledby=\"headingObjectives\" data-bs-parent=\"#sedgsAccordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<ul class=\"px-0 unstyled-ul\">\n<li class=\"mb-2 star text-justify list-unstyled\">To protect all the constitutional rights of the SEDGs students.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 star text-justify list-unstyled\">To ensure that the HEIs are inclusive, safe, and secure for the SEDGs students.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 star text-justify list-unstyled\">To provide socio-emotional and academic support and mentoring for the students belonging to the SEDGs through proper counselling and monitoring programme.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 star text-justify list-unstyled\">To ensure proper implementation and monitoring of orientation and bridge courses designed by the HEIs to benefit SEDGs students.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 star text-justify list-unstyled\">To ensure implementation of all such programme designed and developed by HEIs to increase the participation of SEDGs students in academic activities.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 star text-justify list-unstyled\">To ensure implementation of Government\'s Policies, Including reservation Policies and various schemes, Programme, facilities and guidelines for SEDGs students.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 star text-justify list-unstyled\">To ensure that the HEIs develop appropriate outreach programme to help the SEDGs students to avail the various opportunities of educational/ academics programmes of HEIs</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 star text-justify list-unstyled\">To ensure proper implementation of preventive measures and Laws against discrimination and atrocities, and for safeguards of students belonging to respective categories under SEDGs.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 star text-justify list-unstyled\">To circulate, publicize, facilitate and monitor the implementation of all UGC and Government guidelines and instruction issued from time to time in reference to SEDGs</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 star text-justify list-unstyled\">To redress the grievances and complaints of the SEDGs students within 15 days through a Grievances Redressal Committee (GRC) without compromising the safety, privacy and dignity of the complainant.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Functions Accordion Item -->\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"headingFunctions\" class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseFunctions\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapseFunctions\"> Functions of SEDGs Cell: </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseFunctions\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFunctions\" data-bs-parent=\"#sedgsAccordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<ul class=\"px-0 unstyled-ul\">\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To co-ordinate with other existing cells and statutory bodies of the HEIs and enable implementation of the existing schemes and provision, including scholarships and fellowship of the Govt. of India and respective States.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To ensure the implementation of orientation and bridge courses, earn while- learn schemes, and outreach programme designed and developed by HEIs for SEDGs.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To provide socio economics, academics and psychological support and mentoring for such students through proper counselling and mentoring programme.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To ensure sensitization of faculty, staff, counsellors and students on the SEDGs issues and their inclusion in all aspects of the HEIs.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To explore and generate funds from various sources like Corporate Social Responsibilities (CSR) and Alumni to provide more financial assistances and scholarships to SEDGs to mitigate opportunity costs and fees for pursuing higher education.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To coordinate with the Internal Quality Assurance Cell (IQAC) to raise awareness about the implementation of various policies for inclusive and equitable quality higher education.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To work as a \'Single Window\' for students belonging to SEDGs for their Grievances, basic needs, amenities, facilities, welfare measures, and Scholarships and Fellowships.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To upload and disseminate guidelines facilities, welfare and safety measures on HEIs portal and maintain such records to review and monitor amenities and basic facilities for a safe and secure environment for SEDGs</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To circulate, publicize and facilitate existing welfare schemes like &ndash; Remedial, NET, entry into services.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To establish a team of counsellors, social workers, and faculty members to provide emotional and social support to SEDGs to adapt to the environment of the HEI.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To focus on overall personality and skill development, including professional and soft skills, so as to ensure enhancing the student employability.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To organize periodic meetings and to monitor the progress of various schemes and all the HEIs may prepare a database of such schemes for SEDGs.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To assess the needs of SEDGs and make necessary recommendations to the authorities of the HEIs.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To make faculty, staff, students, and service professionals aware of facilities available for SEDGs.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To sensitize all the students to bring an attitudinal change towards SEDGs to ensure participation of SEDGs in curricular, co-curricular, and extra-curricular activities in the HEIs.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To hold regular meetings with representatives of SEDG students to check their grievances and also meet with management/authorities of HEIs to facilitate discussion of the grievances of SEDG students and maintain the confidentiality of deliberations and data.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To review, monitor, and ensure disposal of all grievances within 15 days.</li>\n<li class=\"mb-2 sparkle text-justify list-unstyled\">To inform all students during induction/counselling session about Zero- tolerance policy for any form of discrimination.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h5 class=\"section-title mt-2\">Composition:</h5>\n<h5 class=\"section-title mt-2\">Governance of SEDGs Cell:</h5>\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-striped table-head-style\">\n<thead class=\"text-center\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"serial-width\">Sr. No.</th>\n<th class=\"text-start\" scope=\"col\">Designation</th>\n<th class=\"text-start\" scope=\"col\">Name</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"text-center\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">1</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Chairperson, SEDGs Cell</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\"><strong>Dr. Rajshree Trivedi</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">2</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Senior Professor Member</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\"><strong>Dr. Ravindra Katyayan</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">3</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">In-charge, Internal Complaint Committee Member</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\"><strong>Dr. Cicilia Chettiar</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">4</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Coordinator/Director, IQAC Member</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\"><strong>Dr. Anuja Deshpande</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">5</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">SC/ST Representative Member</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\"><strong>Dr. Prerna Ramteke</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">6</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">OBC Representative Member</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\"><strong>Ms. Sheetal Sawant</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"align-middle\" style=\"text-align: right;\" rowspan=\"2\">7</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle text-start\" rowspan=\"2\">Two Student Representatives belonging to SEDGs Members</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\"><strong>Ms. Atika Tanvar (SYBA)</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-start\"><strong>Ms. Namrata Dhavse (SYBA)</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\">8</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Assistant Registrar/Administrative Officer Member Secretary</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\"><strong>Ms. Aarti Mahdik</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-5\"><a class=\"btn-pdf w-100\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/copy-1765875485-Guidelines-to-Provide-Equitable-Opportunity-for-the-Socio-Economically-Disadvantaged-Group-SEDGs-in-the-HEIs.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Guideline</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'socio-economically-disadvantaged-groups-cell', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Socio Economically Disadvantaged Groups Cell', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 279),
(364, 'Guidelines', '', '<div class=\"guidlines\">\n<div class=\"row g-3\">\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\"><a class=\"btn-pdf w-100\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/1Compliance-with-UGC-Regulations-Guidelines.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"btn-text\">UGC Regulations Guidelines</span></a></div>\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\"><a class=\"btn-pdf w-100\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/2Guidelines-for-Establishment-of-Research-Development-Cell-in-Higher-Education-Institutions-HEIs.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Research &amp; Development Cell </span></a></div>\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\"><a class=\"btn-pdf w-100\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/3Guidelines-for-Institutional-Development-Plans-for-Higher-Education-Institutions.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <span class=\"btn-text\">Institutional Development Plans</span></a></div>\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\"><a class=\"btn-pdf w-100\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/4Guidelines-Accessibility-Guidelines-and-Standards-for-Higher-Education-Institutions-and-Universities.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Accessibility Guidelines</span></a></div>\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\"><a class=\"btn-pdf w-100\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/5Guidelines-to-Provide-Equitable-Opportunity-for-the-Socio-Economically-Disadvantaged-Group-SEDGs-in-the-HEIs.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"btn-text\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Equal Opportunity Cell</span></span></a></div>\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\"><a class=\"btn-pdf w-100\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/6ICC-regulations.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"btn-text\">ICC Regulations</span></a></div>\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\"><a class=\"btn-pdf w-100\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/7SGRC-Regulations-2023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"btn-text\">SGRC Regulations</span></a></div>\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\"><a class=\"btn-pdf w-100\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/8UGC-Fee-Refund-Policy-2024-25.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <span class=\"btn-text\">UGC Fee Refund Policy</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'guidelines', 'user_defined', 0, 'Guidelines', '', '', 'Guidelines', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 279),
(365, 'Fees Refund Policy', '', '<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3\"><a class=\"btn-pdf w-100\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Fees-Refund-Policy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <span class=\"btn-text\">Fees Refund Policy</span></a></div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'fees-refund-policy', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Fees Refund Policy', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 2),
(366, 'UGC Compliance', '', '<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-5\"><a class=\" btn-pdf w-100\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/UGC-Complaince.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Complaince</span></a></div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'ugc-compliance', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'UGC Compliance', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 279);
