(367, 'Internal Complaint Commitee', '', '<div class=\"row justify-content-center unified-layout\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-3 nav-pills-desktop\">\n<div id=\"v-pills-tab\" class=\"nav flex-column nav-pills\" role=\"tablist\"><button id=\"v-tab-internal\" class=\"nav-link active\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#panel-internal\"> Internal Complaint Committee </button> <button id=\"v-tab-grievance\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#panel-grievance\"> Grievance Redressal Cell </button> <button id=\"v-tab-sexual\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#panel-sexual\"> Prevention of Sexual Harassment </button> <button id=\"v-tab-caste\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#panel-caste\"> Prevention of Caste Based Discrimination </button> <button id=\"v-tab-complaint\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#panel-complaint\"> Complaint Form </button> <button id=\"v-tab-ugc\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#panel-ugc\"> UGC Guidelines for ICC </button> <button id=\"v-tab-contact\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#panel-contact\"> Important Contact Numbers </button> <button id=\"v-tab-wdc\" class=\"nav-link\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#panel-wdc\"> Women Development Cell </button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"unified-accordion\" class=\"col-lg-9 tab-content accordion\">\n<div id=\"panel-internal\" class=\"tab-pane fade show active accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseInternal\"> Internal Complaint Committee </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseInternal\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body p-0 pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Internal Complaints Committee</h2>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">The ICC (Internal Complaints Committee), Maniben Nanavati Women\'s College has been formed as per the norms of MHRD and UGC, New Delhi</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">The functions of the Committee would be - prevention, prohibition and redressal of sexual harassment of women employees and students in college premises.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">ICC shall comply with the procedure prescribed in the aforementioned UGC regulation 2016 and the sexual harassment act for inquiring into the complaint in a time bound manner.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">Sexual Harassment of women at workplace (Prevention, Prohibition &amp; Redressal) Act 2013. In accordance with the UGC (Prevention, Prohibition and Redressal of Sexual Harassment of Women Employees and Students in Higher Educational Institutions) Regulations, 2015, the College has an Internal Complaints Committee (ICC) comprising of External and Internal Members.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">As per the guidelines of UGC and the Supreme Court an Anti Sexual Harassment Cell has been established by the College to provide a healthy and congenial atmosphere to the staff and students of the College.</p>\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead\">Objectives of the Cell:</h2>\n<ol class=\"styled-ol\">\n<li>To develop the guidelines and norms for a policy against sexual harassment.</li>\n<li>To develop principles and procedures for combating sexual harassment.</li>\n<li>To work out details for the implementation of the policy.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead\">The Composition:</h2>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">(Section 7 of the 2013 Act provides that an Internal Complaints Committee is to have a minimum of five members)</p>\n<ul class=\"styled-ul\">\n<li><strong>Presiding Officer:</strong> A woman faculty member employed at a senior level; not below the level of an Associate Professor at the educational institution.</li>\n<li>Two faculty members and two non-teaching employees preferably committed to the cause of women or who have had experience in social work or have legal knowledge.</li>\n<li>Two students who are enrolled at the undergraduate and masters\' levels respectively, elected through transparent democratic procedure.</li>\n<li>One member from amongst non-governmental organizations or associations committed to the cause of women or a person familiar with the issues relating to sexual harassment.</li>\n<li>At least one-half of the total members of the ICC shall be women.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead\">Procedure:</h2>\n<ol class=\"styled-ol\">\n<li>An aggrieved person (complainant) is required to submit a written complaint to the ICC within three months from the date of the incident.</li>\n<li>Friends, relatives, colleagues, co-students, psychologist or any other associate of the victim may file the complaint in a situation where the complainant is unable to make the complaint on account of physical or mental incapacity.</li>\n<li>Upon receipt of the complaint, one copy will be sent to the respondent within seven days.</li>\n<li>Immediate interim relief may be provided if the matter is sensitive (under Chapter V, Clause 12 (1) (a) of the 2013 Act).</li>\n<li>The inquiry has to be completed within ninety days from the receipt of the complaint.</li>\n<li>The resolution of the conflict to the full satisfaction of the aggrieved party is preferred to purely punitive action.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"table-responsive mt-4\">\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-striped custom-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-center\" style=\"width: 80px;\">Sr. No.</th>\n<th>Constitution of the ICC</th>\n<th>Members</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-center\">1</td>\n<td>Presiding Officer</td>\n<td><strong>Dr. Cicilia Chettiar</strong> (9820310848)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-center\">2</td>\n<td>Faculty &amp; Non-Teaching Members</td>\n<td>Ms. Neha Bhansali (9821317349)<br />Mrs. Sheetal Sawant (9833880053)<br />Ms. Shruti Gala<br />Advocate Gauri Chhabria</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-center\">3</td>\n<td>NGO Members</td>\n<td>Ms. Asha Kulkarni (9819373522)<br />Mr. Suketu Jarivala (9820737779)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-center\">4</td>\n<td>Elected Student Members</td>\n<td>Ms. Sneha Raut<br />Ms. Zeel Gala<br />Ms. Netra Shah</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-center\">5</td>\n<td>Nominated Non-Teaching Members</td>\n<td>Ms. Keyaa Mukherjee (9890753753)<br />Mr. Naresh Lad (9969163945)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-5 d-flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"btn-pdf\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/1UGC_-Prevention_of_sexual_harassment.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">UGC Regulation 2015</a> <a class=\"btn-pdf\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/2Sanksham_Guidelines.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sanksham Guidelines</a> <a class=\"btn-pdf\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/3Vishaka-Guidelines.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vishakha Guidelines</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"panel-grievance\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseGrievance\"> Grievance Redressal Cell </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseGrievance\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Grievance Redressal Cell</h2>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">As per the UNIVERSITY GRANTS COMMISSION NOTIFICATION New Delhi, the 6th May, 2019, all higher education institutions should establish a Grievance Redressal Cell to provide a mechanism for redressal of grievances of students and staff.</p>\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead\">Composition of the Cell:</h2>\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-striped custom-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-center\" style=\"width: 80px;\">Sr. No.</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Designation</th>\n<th class=\"text-center\">Status</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-center\">1</td>\n<td>Dr. Twinkle Sanghavi</td>\n<td>Senior Faculty Member</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\">Member</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-center\">2</td>\n<td>Dr. Cicilia Chettiar</td>\n<td>Senior Faculty Member</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\">Member</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-center\">3</td>\n<td>Ms. Sheetal Sawant</td>\n<td>Senior Faculty Member</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\">Member</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-center\">4</td>\n<td>Ms. Dhruvi Patel (SYBA)</td>\n<td>Student Representative (Academic/Sports Merit)</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\">Special Invitee</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"styled-ul mt-4\">\n<li>The term of the members and the special invitee shall be two years.</li>\n<li>The quorum for the meeting including the Chairperson shall be three.</li>\n<li>The GRC shall follow principles of natural justice and submit its report within 15 days of receipt of complaint.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"panel-sexual\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseSexual\"> Prevention of Sexual Harassment Cell </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseSexual\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Prevention of Sexual Harassment Cell (Vishakha)</h2>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">Maniben Nanavati Women\'s College is committed to creating an environment free of sexual harassment. Sexual harassment includes unwelcome sexual advances, requests for favors, or physical conduct of a sexual nature.</p>\n<h2 class=\"title-subhead\">Zero Tolerance Policy:</h2>\n<ol class=\"styled-ol\">\n<li>Written complaints can be filed within three months of the incident.</li>\n<li>Conciliation steps may be taken if requested by the aggrieved woman.</li>\n<li>The Employer (Principal) will provide necessary assistance and support throughout the process.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"btn-pdf\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/4policy-on-seexual-bharassment-.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Policy Document</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"panel-caste\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseCaste\"> Prevention of Caste Based Discrimination </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseCaste\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Caste Based Discrimination Cell</h2>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">The college maintains a strict policy against any form of caste-based discrimination and provides a dedicated cell for redressal.</p>\n<div class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"btn-pdf\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/5PDF-CASTE-.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Cell Details</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"panel-complaint\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseComplaint\"> Complaint Form </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseComplaint\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Complaint Form</h2>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">Students or staff members who wish to report an incident can download and submit the formal complaint form below.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"panel-ugc\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseUGC\"> UGC Guidelines for ICC </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseUGC\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">UGC Guidelines</h2>\n<div class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"btn-pdf\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/6UGC-Guidelines-for-ICC-1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download UGC Guidelines</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"panel-contact\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseContact\"> Important Contact Numbers </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseContact\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Emergency Contacts</h2>\n<div class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"btn-pdf\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Screenshot-2025-01-11-121601.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Contact List</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"panel-wdc\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseWDC\"> Women Development Cell </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseWDC\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Women Development Cell</h2>\n<div class=\"row g-3\">\n<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Film-Festival-on-Women-Oriented-Movies_-scaled-420x250.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"womendevp\" data-title=\"International Women\'s Day Celebration\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Film-Festival-on-Women-Oriented-Movies_-scaled-420x250.jpg\" alt=\"International Women\'s Day Celebration\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/International-Womens-Day-Celebration_-scaled-420x250.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"womendevp\" data-title=\"International Women\'s Day Celebration\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/International-Womens-Day-Celebration_-scaled-420x250.jpg\" alt=\"International Women\'s Day Celebration\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Panel-Discussion-on-Women-In-Sports_-Opportunities-and-Challenges-Genderlogue-420x250.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"womendevp\" data-title=\"Panel Discussion on Women In Sports\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Panel-Discussion-on-Women-In-Sports_-Opportunities-and-Challenges-Genderlogue-420x250.jpg\" alt=\"Panel Discussion on Women In Sports\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Play-Performance-on-_Bas-Itni-si-Baat-hai_-by-MAVA-420x250.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"womendevp\" data-title=\"Play Performance by MAVA\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Play-Performance-on-_Bas-Itni-si-Baat-hai_-by-MAVA-420x250.jpg\" alt=\"Play Performance by MAVA\" /> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><a href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Workshop-on-the-art-of-origami_-420x250.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"womendevp\" data-title=\"Workshop on the art of origami\"> <img class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Workshop-on-the-art-of-origami_-420x250.jpg\" alt=\"Workshop on the art of origami\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'internal-complaint-commitee', 'user_defined', 0, 'Internal Complaint Commitee', '', '', 'Internal Complaint Commitee', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 2),
(368, 'Video/Podcast', '', '<div class=\"row g-4\"><!-- Video 1 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6\">\n<div class=\"card podcast-card border-0 shadow-sm\"><img class=\"card-img-top rounded podcast-thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/IhD6OopVziY/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"Video 1 Thumbnail\" data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#videoModal1\" />\n<div class=\"card-body text-center podcast-body\">\n<h6 class=\"podcast-title mb-0\">M.A. - Types of Memory &ndash; Psychology</h6>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Video 2 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6\">\n<div class=\"card podcast-card border-0 shadow-sm\"><img class=\"card-img-top rounded podcast-thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/X2_OkDYhhWM/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"Video 2 Thumbnail\" data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#videoModal2\" />\n<div class=\"card-body text-center podcast-body\">\n<h6 class=\"podcast-title mb-0\">M.A. - Types of Qualitative Research</h6>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Video 3 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6\">\n<div class=\"card podcast-card border-0 shadow-sm\"><img class=\"card-img-top rounded podcast-thumbnail\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/2PDMyjIFiQc/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"Video 3 Thumbnail\" data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#videoModal3\" />\n<div class=\"card-body text-center podcast-body\">\n<h6 class=\"podcast-title mb-0\">M.A. - Worksheets and Therapy Resources</h6>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- ===== Bootstrap Modals ===== -->\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- Modal 1 -->\n<div id=\"videoModal1\" class=\"modal fade podcast-modal\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg\">\n<div class=\"modal-content bg-dark border-0 position-relative\"><button class=\"btn-close btn-close-white position-absolute top-0 end-0 m-3\" type=\"button\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n<div class=\"ratio ratio-16x9\"><iframe title=\"Video 1\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IhD6OopVziY\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Modal 2 -->\n<div id=\"videoModal2\" class=\"modal fade podcast-modal\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg\">\n<div class=\"modal-content bg-dark border-0 position-relative\"><button class=\"btn-close btn-close-white position-absolute top-0 end-0 m-3\" type=\"button\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n<div class=\"ratio ratio-16x9\"><iframe title=\"Video 2\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/X2_OkDYhhWM\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Modal 3 -->\n<div id=\"videoModal3\" class=\"modal fade podcast-modal\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg\">\n<div class=\"modal-content bg-dark border-0 position-relative\"><button class=\"btn-close btn-close-white position-absolute top-0 end-0 m-3\" type=\"button\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n<div class=\"ratio ratio-16x9\"><iframe title=\"Video 3\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2PDMyjIFiQc\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'videopodcast', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'VideoPodcast', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 235),
(369, 'Presentation', '', '<div class=\"presentation\">\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-striped text-center table-head-style\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"table-dark\">\n<th class=\"serial-width\">Sr. No.</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Department</th>\n<th>Document</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">1</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.A. &ndash; Group Therapy</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/1Group-Therapy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">2</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.A. &ndash; Basic Counselling Skills</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/2Basic-Counseling-Skills_Training-Module1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">3</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.A. &ndash; Application of Psychological Tests</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/3Module-IV-Psychological-Testing-and-Assessment.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">4</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.A. &ndash; Fundamentals of Neuropsychology</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/4Neuro-NEP-unit-1-.pptx-1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">5</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.A. &ndash; Existential Therapy</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/5Existential-Therapy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">6</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.Com &ndash; Risk Management In Mutual Funds Investment</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/6Risk-Management-In-Mutual-Funds-Investment.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">7</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.Com &ndash; Capital Budgeting</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/7capital-budgeting.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">8</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.Com &ndash; Marketing of Financial Services</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/8Marketing-of-financial-services.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">9</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.Com &ndash; Impact of 5g on E-Commerce</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/9Impact-of-5g-on-e-commerce.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">10</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.Com &ndash; Mutual Funds</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/10Mutual-Funds.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'presentation', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Presentation', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 279),
(370, 'Study Material', '', '<div class=\"study-material\">\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-striped table-head-style text-center\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"table-dark\">\n<th class=\"serial-width\">Sr. No.</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Department</th>\n<th class=\"text-center document-heading-width\">Document</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">1</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.A. &ndash; Couples Therapy &ndash; An Overview</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/1couples-therapy-an-overview.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">2</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.A. &ndash; Action Research Basics</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/2action-research-basics.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">3</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.A. &ndash; Play Therapy</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/3Play-Therapy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">4</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.A. &ndash; Indian Approach to Mental Health</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/4Indian-Approach-to-mental-health.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">5</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.A. &ndash; Clinical Psychology in India &ndash; 2001</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/5Clinical-Psychology-in-India-2001.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">6</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.Com &ndash; Financial Management</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Financial-Management.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">7</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.Com &ndash; Financial Management 2</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Financial-Management-2.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">8</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.Com &ndash; Human Resource Management</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Human-Resource-Management.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">9</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.Com &ndash; Organisational Behaviour</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Organisational-Behaviour.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">10</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">M.Com &ndash; Strategic Management</td>\n<td class=\"align-middle\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Strategic-Management.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'study-material', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Study Material', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 279),
(371, 'Certificate', '', '', 'new_window', 'https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/NAAC-Year-2025-743x1024.png', 'custom_link', 0, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, 1, NULL, 0, '', '1970-01-02', 0),
(372, 'Anti Ragging Cell', '', '<div class=\"Anti-Ragging-cell\"><!-- Introduction and Image Section -->\n<div class=\"row mb-3\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-3 order-1 order-lg-2 d-flex justify-content-center \"><img class=\"img-fluid w-lg-75 rounded shadow\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/MNWC-Sliding-Event-3-724x1024.png\" alt=\"Anti Ragging Awareness\" /></div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-9 col-12 order-lg-1 order-2\">\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">There is Zero Tolerance for ragging in the college. Any student found participating in any form of ragging, within college premises or outside, offline or online, shall on conviction be punished with a fine and a prison sentence as per the directives of the Supreme Court of India. The Anti-Ragging Committee (ARC) in college is formed as per the UGC rules. The primary objective of the ARC is to make sure no student is harmed physically or psychologically and to ensure sensitivity by all students towards everyone in the institution.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">Members of the committee regularly go on rounds to classrooms and observe the behavior of students. They are accessible for feedback from teachers, students and any others who have observed ragging in any form. The committee will take severe disciplinary action against those found guilty.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">There is also a Suggestion Box placed in the college lobby that students can use to make complaints. Alternately, students are free to approach committee members or any teacher they are comfortable with. There is also a provision to submit complaints online through the college website. Discretion of the committee is assured in delicate matters. Students on their part are advised to not complain about trivial issues else it will lead to strict action being taken.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">The complaints received will be completely confidential and not used against them by the committee.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Ragging Behavior and Punishments Section -->\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<h5 class=\" section-title \">Following behaviour can be considered as ragging</h5>\n<ul class=\"px-0  inner-para unstyled-ul text-justify\">\n<li class=\"star\">Compel other student to copy notes for someone.</li>\n<li class=\"star\">Compel other student to do other work.</li>\n<li class=\"star\">Compel student to do menial jobs for seniors.</li>\n<li class=\"star\">Speak or behave vulgar.</li>\n<li class=\"star\">Consume alcohol or smoke in college.</li>\n<li class=\"star\">Behaviour which may cause physical or mental harm.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<h5 class=\"section-title\">Punishments at the Institution Level</h5>\n<p class=\"text-justify inner-para\">The punishment for ragging will depend on the nature of the ragging episode. The following may be the action taken.</p>\n<ul class=\"text-justify unstyled-ul px-0 \">\n<li class=\"sparkle\">Suspend from attending classes till an enquiry is done.</li>\n<li class=\"sparkle\">Withhold or Cancel any scholarships or aids given to the student.</li>\n<li class=\"sparkle\">Prohibit from appearing for a test or exam or evaluation.</li>\n<li class=\"sparkle\">Withhold results.</li>\n<li class=\"sparkle\">Prevent from representing the college in inter-collegiate events.</li>\n<li class=\"sparkle\">Fine for ragging.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'anti-ragging-cell', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Anti Ragging Cell', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 236),
