(381, 'Video Gallery', '', '<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; max-width: 400px; margin: 10px; text-align: center;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/7eTL48EuOEc\" width=\"100%\" height=\"200\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe>\n<p><strong>वावेघर शाळेत कौशल्य विकास कार्यक्रम संपन्न&hellip;</strong></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; max-width: 400px; margin: 10px; text-align: center;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/XgZM5sULVF0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"200\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe>\n<p><strong>World Mental Health Day Celebrations</strong></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; max-width: 400px; margin: 10px; text-align: center;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/aPSOHPoDH24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"200\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe>\n<p><strong>A song for suicide prevention</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; max-width: 400px; margin: 10px; text-align: center;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pACLXk0WXW8\" width=\"100%\" height=\"200\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe>\n<p><strong>मणिबेन नानावटी महिला महाविद्यालय में है कैरियर सीखने के ऑप्शन</strong></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; max-width: 400px; margin: 10px; text-align: center;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BSJeivztmG4\" width=\"100%\" height=\"200\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe>\n<p><strong>The Compulsions</strong></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; max-width: 400px; margin: 10px; text-align: center;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIDEO_ID\" width=\"100%\" height=\"200\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe>\n<p><strong>New Video Title</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'video-gallery', 'user_defined', 0, 'Video Gallery', '', '', 'Video Gallery', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 235),
(383, 'sample desktop', '', '<!-- Desktop View Only ------------------------>\n<div class=\"container page-content d-none d-lg-block\">\n<div class=\"row\"><!-- LEFT SIDE TABS -->\n<div class=\"col-3\">\n<div id=\"v-pills-tab\" class=\"nav flex-column nav-pills\" role=\"tablist\"><button class=\"nav-link active\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#about\"> About the College Office </button> <button class=\"nav-link\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#admin\"> Administrative Staff </button> <button class=\"nav-link\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#support\"> Support Staff </button> <button class=\"nav-link\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#working\"> College Office Working </button> <button class=\"nav-link\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#resources\"> Resources and Equipment </button> <button class=\"nav-link\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#reports\"> Reports </button></div>\n</div>\n<!-- RIGHT SIDE CONTENT -->\n<div class=\"col-9\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><!-- ABOUT SECTION -->\n<div id=\"about\" class=\"tab-pane fade show active\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">About the College Office</h2>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">Maniben Nanavati Women&rsquo;s College has a fully air- conditioned, automated and computerized Office with spacious, ergonomic cubicles for the Non &ndash; Teaching. The College Office is situated at the Main Foyer of the College premises. One of the most striking feature of the Administrative Department is that each and every correspondence that comes in or goes out is DIGITALIZED and immediately tagged to the concerned person(s). &ldquo;Reduce, Reuse, Recycle&rdquo; is the nurtured habit and culture in the College Office. Dignitaries from the government, non-government, industry, corporate houses and other bodies have written<strong> APPRECIATIVE COMMENTS</strong> for the functioning of the College Office. Mrs. Keyaa Mukherjee, the Office Superintendent has been the recipient of the prestigious <strong>Bharat</strong> <strong>Ratna Maharshi Karve Utkrushta Shiksakettar Puraskar</strong> in 2016 by the SNDT Women&rsquo;s University. Shree Devendra Fadanvis, the erstwhile Chief Minister of Maharashtra did the honor while appreciating her for her outstanding contribution to her area of work.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- ADMINISTRATIVE STAFF SECTION -->\n<div id=\"admin\" class=\"tab-pane fade\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Administrative Staff</h2>\n<!-- Your Complete Administrative Staff Data -->\n<h2 class=\"title-head mt-2\">Aided Staff:</h2>\n<!-- Row 1 -->\n<div class=\"row text-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/1.-Keyaa-Mukherjee.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Mrs. Keyaa Mukherjee</strong></p>\n<p>Recipient of Best Non-Teaching Staff Award 2015-16</p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Office Superintendent</p>\n<p><strong>Email:</strong> keyaa.mukherjee@mnwc.edu.in</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 06/07/1992</p>\n<p><strong>Nature of Work:</strong> Coordinator &amp; In-Charge of Administration Department</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3 h-100\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/2.-Aarati-Mahadik.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Aarati Mahadik</strong></p>\n<p>Recipient of Best Non-Teaching Staff Award 2021-22</p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Head Clerk</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 01/04/1999</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3 h-100\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/3.-Ujwala-Padhye.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Ujwala Padhye</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Senior Clerk</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 25/07/2019</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Row 2 -->\n<div class=\"row text-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/4.-Naresh-Lad.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Naresh Lad</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Senior Clerk</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 22/06/1993</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Gayatri-Sarode.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Gayatri Sarode</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Junior Clerk</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 10/07/2012</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Anushka-Shivade.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Anushka Shivade</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Junior Clerk</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 25/06/2013</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Row 3 -->\n<div class=\"row text-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Santosh-Okate.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Santosh Okate</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Library Clerk</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 25/06/2013</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-4\" /><!-- Unaided Staff -->\n<h2 class=\"title-head mt-2\">Unaided Admin Staff:</h2>\n<div class=\"row text-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Dhanashree-Joshi.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Dhanashree Joshi</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Admin Executive</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 01/06/2017</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Prashant-Chaugule.png\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Prashant Chaugule</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Junior Clerk</p>\n<p><str