are.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Sakshi Tatkare</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Accountant</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 18/04/1995</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card bncdc-staff p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Supriya-Dholam.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Supriya Dholam</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Junior Clerk</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 20/04/2019</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row text-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card bncdc-staff p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Divya-Sondkar.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Divya Sondkar</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Junior Clerk</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 25/07/2019</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- SUPPORT STAFF SECTION -->\n<div id=\"support\" class=\"tab-pane fade\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Support Staff</h2>\n<!-- AIDED SUPPORT STAFF -->\n<h2 class=\"title-head mt-2\">Aided Support Staff:</h2>\n<div class=\"row text-center\"><!-- 1 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #000;\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Jayram-Dhumal.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Jayram Dhumal</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Library Attendant</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 01/04/1999</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #000;\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Ankush-Polekar.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Ankush Polekar</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Library Attendant</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 01/02/2010</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 3 -->\n<div