.in/uploads/Ms.-Vandana-Keni.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Vandana Keni</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Lab Attendant</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 01/09/2013</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 3 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #000;\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Rajendra-Bane.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Rajendra Bane</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Peon</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 07/11/2005</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 4 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #000;\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Jagdish-Jangale.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Jagdish Jangale</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Peon</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 02/08/2010</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 5 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #000;\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Tulsa-Waghela.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Tulsa Waghela</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Sweeper</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 28/03/2012</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 6 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #000;\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Manjula-Solanki.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Manjula Solanki</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Sweeper</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 01/09/2021</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 7 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #000;\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Bhikaji-Gade.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Bhikaji Gade</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Peon cum Housekeeping</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 02/05/2023</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 8 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #000;\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Bharati-Solanki.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Bharati Solanki</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Sweeper cum Housekeeping</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 19/05/2023</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 9 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #000;\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Ravindra-Chogale.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Ravindra Chogale</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Peon</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 02/01/2024</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 10 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #000;\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Pandharinath-Parab.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Pandharinath Parab</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Peon</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 15/03/2024</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-4\" /><!-- BNCDC SUPPORT STAFF -->\n<h2 class=\"title-head mt-2\">BNCDC Support Staff:</h2>\n<div class=\"row text-center\"><!-- 1 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3 bncdc-staff\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #000;\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Suresh-Chaugule.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Suresh Chaugule</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Peon</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 01/04/1999</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2 -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3 bncdc-staff\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #000;\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Soniya-Mahida.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Soniya Mahida</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Peon cum Sweeper</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 01/01/2023</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- WORKING SECTION -->\n<div id=\"working\" class=\"tab-pane fade\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">College Office Working</h2>\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul inner-para text-justify my-0\">\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">The office is open daily from 9:00 AM to 4:00 PM &ndash; Monday to Saturday except Sundays and holidays.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Office oversees the day-to-day operations of the College including facility management, communication between students, faculty, staff and other stakeholders.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Students may refer complaints to the Head of the Admin Office.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Courtesy is appreciated and will be welcomed.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<!-- RESOURCES SECTION -->\n<div id=\"resources\" class=\"tab-pane fade\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Resources and Equipment</h2>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul inner-para text-justify my-0\">\n<li>Number of computers: 20</li>\n<li>Laptops: 4</li>\n<li>Printers: 12</li>\n<li>Scanners: 3</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n<ul class=\"unstyled-ul inner-para text-justify my-0\">\n<li>Xerox machine: 1</li>\n<li>Paper shredders: 1</li>\n<li>Internet connectivity</li>\n<li>Fully Automated Office Management System</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- REPORTS SECTION -->\n<div id=\"reports\" class=\"tab-pane fade\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Reports</h2>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-striped table-head-style\">\n<thead class=\"table-dark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"serial-width\">Sr. No.</th>\n<th class=\"text-start\">Title</th>\n<th class=\"text-center\">Document</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">1</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Admin Srishti 2023-2024</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Admin-Srishti-2023-2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Report</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">2</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Admin Srishti 2022-2023</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Admin-Srishti-2022-2023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Report</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">3</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Admin Srishti 2021-2022</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Admin-Srishti-2021-2022.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Report</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">4</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Admin Srishti 2020-2021</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Admin-Srishti-2020-2021.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Report</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">5</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Admin Srishti 2019-2020</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Admin-Srishti-2019-2020.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Report</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">6</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Admin Srishti 2018-2019</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Admin-Srishti-2018-2019.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Report</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">7</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Admin Srishti 2017-2018</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Admin-Srishti-2017-2018.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Report</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">8</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Admin Srishti 2016-2017</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Admin-Shrishti-2016-2017.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Report</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"text-end\">9</td>\n<td class=\"text-start\">Admin Srishti 2015-2016</td>\n<td class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"view-btn\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Admin-Srishti-2015-2016.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Report</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr class=\"my-4\" />\n<div class=\"row text-center\"><!-- First PDF -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4\"><a class=\"btn-pdf\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Admin-Srishti-2023-2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <span class=\"btn-text\">Digitized Administrative Office</span> </a></div>\n<!-- Second PDF -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4\"><a class=\"btn-pdf\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Office-Automation.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <span class=\"btn-text\">Office Automation</span> </a></div>\n<!-- Blank space (optional) -->\n<div class=\"col-md-4\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Desktop Tabs: HIDDEN on all devices ---------------------------------------------------mobile----------------------------->\n<div class=\"d-none\"><!-- Previous desktop vertical tabs code can remain here if needed, but it will never show --></div>\n<!-- Mobile Accordion: VISIBLE only on mobile -->\n<div class=\"d-lg-none\">\n<div id=\"accordionExample\" class=\"accordion\"><!-- 1: About the College Office -->\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"headingAbout\" class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseAbout\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"collapseAbout\"> About the College Office </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseAbout\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" aria-labelledby=\"headingAbout\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionExample\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\">\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">Maniben Nanavati Women&rsquo;s College has a fully air-conditioned, automated and computerized Office with spacious, ergonomic cubicles for the Non-Teaching. The College Office is situated at the Main Foyer of the College premises. One of the most striking features of the Administrative Department is that each and every correspondence that comes in or goes out is DIGITALIZED and immediately tagged to the concerned person(s). &ldquo;Reduce, Reuse, Recycle&rdquo; is the nurtured habit and culture in the College Office.</p>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">Dignitaries from the government, non-government, industry, corporate houses and other bodies have written <strong>APPRECIATIVE COMMENTS</strong> for the functioning of the College Office. Mrs. Keyaa Mukherjee, the Office Superintendent, has been the recipient of the prestigious <strong>Bharat Ratna Maharshi Karve Utkrushta Shiksakettar Puraskar </strong> in 2016 by the SNDT Women&rsquo;s University. Shree Devendra Fadanvis, the erstwhile Chief Minister of Maharashtra, did the honor while appreciating her for her outstanding contribution to her area of work.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2: Administrative Staff -->\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"headingAdmin\" class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseAdmin\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapseAdmin\"> Administrative Staff </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseAdmin\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"headingAdmin\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionExample\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body\"><!-- Aided Staff -->\n<h2 class=\"title-head mt-2\">Aided Staff:</h2>\n<div class=\"row text-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/1.-Keyaa-Mukherjee.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Mrs. Keyaa Mukherjee</strong></p>\n<p>Best Non-Teaching Staff Award 2015-16</p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Office Superintendent</p>\n<p><strong>Email:</strong> keyaa.mukherjee@mnwc.edu.in</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 06/07/1992</p>\n<p><strong>Nature of Work:</strong> Coordinator &amp; In-Charge of Administration Department</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3 h-100\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/2.-Aarati-Mahadik.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Aarati Mahadik</strong></p>\n<p>Best Non-Teaching Staff Award 2021-22</p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Head Clerk</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 01/04/1999</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3 h-100\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/3.-Ujwala-Padhye.jpg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Ujwala Padhye</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Senior Clerk</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 25/07/2019</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Row 2 -->\n<div class=\"row text-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/4.-Naresh-Lad.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Mr. Naresh Lad</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Designation:</strong> Senior Clerk</p>\n<p><strong>Date of Appointment:</strong> 22/06/1993</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"staff-card p-3\"><img class=\"img-fluid mb-3\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Gayatri-Sarode.jpeg\" />\n<p><strong>Ms. Gayatri Sarode</strong></p>\n<p><