(441, 'Principal’s Desk', '', '<div class=\"principal-section\">\n<div class=\"message-content\">\n<div class=\"row mt-4 mb-4\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-8\"><span class=\"message-font\">Dear Girls,</span>\n<p><span class=\"highlight-word\"><strong>Connect.</strong></span> The most powerful word enables you to explore and avail endless opportunities in the digital world today. But more than that, on an emotional note, it brings people together to interact, share, exchange, help or support one another. Once connected well with <strong>resources</strong> &ndash; human or other &ndash; <strong>success and accomplishments</strong> are your easy takeaways.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-2\">At <strong>Maniben Nanavati Women\'s College</strong>, you get endless opportunities to connect, succeed and accomplish all that you dream and desire. Surrounded by <strong>lush green trees</strong> and a healthy environment, the well maintained college campus offers you state-of-the-art infrastructure, excellent academic environment and the most modern amenities to grow, excel and achieve in all walks of life.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-2\">A home away from home where learning becomes an interesting and exciting activity, dear student, you will find yourself comfortable among the faculty of <strong>well qualified teachers</strong>. Be it academics, research, co-curricular or extracurricular activities, sports, cultural events, community service or extension work, MNWC provides excellent opportunities for your all round development and growth.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-2\">The college offers you a <strong>plethora of options</strong> to choose from a wide range of courses at various levels &ndash; HSC Board, Undergraduate, Post-Graduate, Diploma, Certificate and Short Term courses. <strong>Internship, job placements, dissertation, skill development courses</strong> and the use of ICT in learning prepare you for the employment market. So, do experience and invest well in your academic pursuits here and have a wonderful future ahead.</p>\n<div class=\"closing-message\">\n<p>See you all soon in the corridors and classrooms!</p>\n<p class=\"mt-2\">Lots of love and warm wishes!</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<div class=\"principal-info2\"><img class=\"principal-photo\" src=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/web-assets/img/principal.jpg\" alt=\"Dr. Rajshree Trivedi\" />\n<div class=\"principal-name\">Dr. Rajshree Trivedi</div>\n<div class=\"principal-title\">Principal</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'principals-desk', 'user_defined', 0, 'Principal’s Desk', '', '', 'Principals Desk', 1, NULL, 1, '', '1970-01-02', 2);
