(469, 'Research & Development Cell (RDC) (Self Funded Research Centre)', '', '<div class=\"row\"><!-- LEFT SIDE TABS (Desktop Only) -->\n<div class=\"col-lg-3 nav-pills-desktop\">\n<div id=\"v-pills-tab\" class=\"nav flex-column nav-pills\" role=\"tablist\"><button class=\"nav-link active\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#about\"> About RDC </button> <button class=\"nav-link\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#admin\"> Research Horizon </button> <button class=\"nav-link\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#support\"> Research Proposal Form </button> <button class=\"nav-link\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#working\"> RDC Policies </button> <button class=\"nav-link\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#resources\"> EIRA - Research Paper Competition </button> <button class=\"nav-link\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#reports\"> Gallery </button></div>\n</div>\n<!-- RIGHT SIDE CONTENT (Shared between Mobile & Desktop) -->\n<div class=\"col-lg-9\">\n<div id=\"unified-accordion\" class=\"tab-content accordion\"><!--1-->\n<div id=\"about\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0 active show\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseAbout\"> About RDC </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseAbout\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body principal-wrapper p-0 pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">INTRODUCTION TO THE INSTITUTION:</h2>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">Maniben Nanavati Women&rsquo;s College , established in 1972, is affiliated to SNDT Women&rsquo;s University, Mumbai and is one of the pioneers in the field of imparting higher education to women. The College offers a wide range of programmes and courses at undergraduate and post graduate levels. Along with academics, the college offers a conducive environment and resources for imparting value education, skill development programmes, research culture. Internship and placement opportunities to students to prepare them for being intelligent, efficient , productive and socially responsible global citizens of tomorrow.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">HISTORY AND BACKGROUND:</h2>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">In 2002 , the College started its in-house academic publication &ndash; Anveshan- to encourage teaching faculty to publish research papers. In our endeavour to reach out to more teachers and encourage serious research, our college took a big step forward that of officially registering Anveshan as Research Horizons at New Delhi, under the Reg no. MAHMUL0Z135/13/2005TC dated 7th Nov. 2005. Eventually Research Horizons was upgraded as an International Research Journal with ISSN and currently it stands enlisted with the EBSCO, USA.</p>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">In 2009, the College established Research Cell to encourage the teaching faculty members to undertake research projects in their own areas of specialization as well as in interdisciplinary and multidisciplinary studies. The College started an In-house as well as Intercollegiate Research Paper Competition which waeventually named as Anveshan Research Paper Competition. The College has won accolades at AVISHKAR State Level Research competition for three consecutive years and reached up to National Level.</p>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">Major and Minor research projects funded by UGC and other bodies had been one of the striking features of the Research Cell. Encouraging teachers to undertake Ph.D and M.Phil. studies had been one of the main objectives of the Cell.</p>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">The students of Post graduate Departments of Psychology and Commerce work on dissertation projects in Semester IV which carries a weightage of 4 credits as a partial obligation to their degree programme. The College has a well established Ethic Committee that reviews each research proposal for dissertations as well as others.</p>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">With a view to expand and widen the scope of activities of the Research Cell, the IQAC recommended the establishment of a well established research centre that would support high impact research projects that are socially relevant, locally need based, nationally important and of global significance.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">VISION</h2>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">To be a premier research centre enabling global development by strategically partnering with research endeavours guided by excellence and innovation.</p>\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">MISSION</h2>\n<ul class=\"inner-para text-justify\">\n<li>To provide scientists and researchers with a stimulating and supportive research environment.</li>\n<li>To engage whole-heartedly with society by establishing avenues that lead to growth in all sectors</li>\n<li>To promote multi-disciplinary training to researchers seeking advanced tools and techniques aimed at improving methodologies</li>\n<li>To encourage a forum to share questions and findings in various disciplines</li>\n<li>To enable access to knowledge from experts in various fields.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">AIMS</h2>\n<ul class=\"inner-para text-justify\">\n<li>Establishment of a world-class multidisciplinary research centre</li>\n<li>Innovation would be the driving philosophy</li>\n<li>Culture specific research will be encouraged</li>\n<li>Application based research will be highlighted</li>\n<li>Research support for faculty and students will be provided</li>\n<li>Transfer of knowledge will be enabled smoothly</li>\n<li>Consolidation and mobilization of data that will be shared</li>\n<li>Enhancement reputation of the institution and its members</li>\n<li>International presence to ensure globally relevant research</li>\n<li>Management resources effectively for the overall functioning</li>\n<li>Contribution to national policies, well-being, economy</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">OBJECTIVES</h2>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">The purposes of establishing a Research Centre are to:</p>\n<ul class=\"inner-para text-justify\">\n<li>Promote and facilitate collaborative and/or interdisciplinary research and enhancement of research networking capacity and infrastructure.</li>\n<li>Increase and effectively manage the resources and research support for its members and the wider university community.</li>\n<li>Provide education and training in research and related skills, especially for graduate and undergraduate students and thereby enhance the academic programs of their constituent academic units.</li>\n<li>Contribute to the university&rsquo;s strategic educational and research missions and to support synergies between research, teaching and learning.</li>\n<li>Transfer and mobilize knowledge gained through research for the benefit of society, via a variety of mechanisms as appropriate.</li>\n<li>Enhance the reputation of the institution&rsquo;s members, the constituent academic units, and the university through the quality of its work.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">SCOPE</h2>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">The Research Centre carries out a broad programme of research and development in all fields with the aim of identifying, creating and sustaining the well-being of this planet and all it&rsquo;s inhabitants.</p>\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">ACTIVITIES</h2>\n<ul class=\"inner-para text-justify\">\n<li>Publication of Research Horizons</li>\n<li>Training students for Anveshan, the MNWC Intercollege Research competition</li>\n<li>Training students for Avishkar, the State, Zonal and National Research Convention</li>\n<li>Funding Short Duration Research Projects of scholars: one in-house, one external, one student project every year.</li>\n<li>Research can be conducted in English and in any Indian regional languages.</li>\n<li>Publication of findings and knowledge sharing.</li>\n<li>Converting research reports into documentary films for wider dissemination.</li>\n<li>Smt. Kantaben Shah Memorial Lecture (Annual) to be conducted during the winters of each year.</li>\n<li>Seminars/Workshops/Trainings for Capacity Building (only research based) for faculty and students.</li>\n<li>Workshops on writing styles &ndash; academic/journalistic/report writing etc.</li>\n<li>MOU&rsquo;s with National and International Institutions.</li>\n<li>Obtaining research grants from GOs, NGOs and Private/Public Foundations</li>\n<li>Functioning of Ethics Committee as per ethical guidelines of the institution.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">ADVISORY BOARD</h2>\n<ul class=\"inner-para text-justify\">\n<li>Smt. Himadri Nanavati &ndash; Chief Patron</li>\n<li>Smt. Angela Shah &ndash; Patron</li>\n<li>Shri Pratapbhai Patel &ndash; Patron</li>\n<li>Dr. Yogini Sheth &ndash; Member</li>\n<li>Dr. Vibhuti Patel- Chief Advisor &amp; Expert</li>\n<li>Dr. Rajshree Trivedi- Director</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE</h2>\n<ul class=\"inner-para text-justify\">\n<li>Principal and all Heads of Departments.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Sub-Committees</h2>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\"><strong>a) Ethics Committee</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"inner-para text-justify\">\n<li>Dr Malathi Iyer (Chairperson)</li>\n<li>Dr. Twinkle Sanghavi (Secretary)</li>\n<li>Advocate Darshika Maiya</li>\n<li>Doctor- Dr. Sonal Desai</li>\n</ul>\n<br />\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\"><strong>b) Anveshan</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"inner-para text-justify\">\n<li>Prof. Vibhuti, Patel-Expert</li>\n<li>Ms. Sheetal Sawant</li>\n<li>Dr. Swati Partani</li>\n<li>Ms. Neha Bhansali</li>\n</ul>\n<br />\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\"><strong>c) Research Horizons</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"inner-para text-justify\">\n<li>Dr Swati Partani-Executive Editor</li>\n<li>Dr. Ravindra Katyayan</li>\n<li>Ms. Sheetal Sawant</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--2-->\n<div id=\"admin\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseAdmin\"> Research Horizon </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseAdmin\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body principal-wrapper p-0 pt-lg-0\"><!-- <h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Research Horizon</h2> -->\n<p class=\"mt-3 pb-3 inner-para text-justify\"><a class=\"text-decoration-underline mb-3\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/research-horizons.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here to View</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--3-->\n<div id=\"support\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseSupport\"> Research Proposal Form </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseSupport\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body principal-wrapper p-0 pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Please submit your proposal in the following format:</h2>\n<ul class=\"inner-para text-justify\">\n<li>Name of the Primary Investigator</li>\n<li>Designation of the Primary Investigator</li>\n<li>Name and designation of the Co-Investigator(s) if any</li>\n<li>Title of the research plan</li>\n<li>Brief Introduction (not more than 500 words)</li>\n<li>Background and statement of the problem (this should be in the light of a thorough literature review)</li>\n<li>Research question, hypotheses, aim and objectives</li>\n<li>Study design (type of study)</li>\n<li>Study population and sampling</li>\n<li>Data collection methods and instruments</li>\n<li>Data analysis methods &ndash; if applicable statistical planning must be fully addressed or the candidate should provide evidence that statistics are not required.</li>\n<li>Mechanisms to assure the quality of the study &ndash; e.g. control of bias, safe storage of data</li>\n<li>Study period &ndash; Timetable for completion of the project</li>\n<li>Participants in the study &ndash; all people involved in the study, and the role they play, should be identified.</li>\n<li>Ethical considerations</li>\n<li>Resources required for the study, including budget if applicable</li>\n<li>References</li>\n<li>Appendices (copy of questionnaire, consent forms, etc.)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--4-->\n<div id=\"working\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseWorking\"> RDC Policies </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseWorking\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body principal-wrapper p-0 pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">RDC Policies</h2>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/KSRC-POLICIES-FOR-RESEARCH-PROJECTS-2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View RDC Policies</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--5-->\n<div id=\"resources\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseResources\"> EIRA - Research Paper Competition </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseResources\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body principal-wrapper p-0 pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">EIRA - Research Paper Competition</h2>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">Dear Friends, <br />EIRA, the national level research paper competition scheduled for 13th Feb has to be rescheduled to the 28th of Feb 2026 due to unavoidable circumstances. Please stay connected on the WA group for regular updates and share this msg with others.<br />Thank you for understanding.</p>\n<p>RULES FOR EIRA &ndash; An intercollegiate research paper competition &ndash; <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mnwc.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/EIRA-Rules-Regulations.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--6-->\n<div id=\"reports\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item border-0\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<h2 class=\"accordion-header accordion-header-mobile\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#collapseReports\"> Gallery </button></h2>\n<div id=\"collapseReports\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" data-bs-parent=\"#unified-accordion\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body principal-wrapper p-0 pt-lg-0\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head sub-head-desktop\">Gallery</h2>\n<p class=\"inner-para text-justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'research--development-cell-rdc-self-funded-research-centre', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Research  Development Cell RDC Self Funded Research Centre', 1, NULL, 1, '', '0000-00-00', 2),
