(84, 89, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, '', '<div class=\"about-library\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<p class=\"text-justify\">MNWC Library is a fully Air conditioned place with an area of 2650 sqft, fully revamped and renovated to meet the reading and reference requirements of students, teachers and research scholars. The library services are automated with SLIM 21 Library Management Software &amp; it&rsquo;s utilized for Books searching, reporting, circulation and various other functions. Barcode and QR code technologies are implemented in the library. OPAC facility is provided by the library which helps the users to locate reading materials by Title, Author &amp; Subjects.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">The Library has active Library Advisory Committee meets twice a year for selection and recommendation of books and other resources &amp; overall development of library.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">The library collection at present includes 39000+ Books, 50+ periodicals, 10 newspapers (Available in English, Hindi, Gujarati &amp; Marathi Language). Free internet facility for students in cyberspace. Reading Room facility, Reprographic services provided in the library.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">Library has subscribed NLIST &amp; J-gate databases.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\"><strong>N List:</strong> Nlist database provide access to e-resources (6,000+ e-journals and 31,35,000+ ebooks).</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\"><strong>Jgate:</strong> It has access to millions of journal articles available online offered by 14,482 Publishers.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\"><strong>Plagiarism Checking Service:</strong> Library has subscribed Drillbit antiplagiarism software. Software detecting plagiarism in documents, it supports National &amp; International languages. The service is availed by faculty and students of the college.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\"><strong>Book Bank Facility:</strong> The library offers a Book Bank Facility to support students by providing sets of essential textbooks for the entire year with nominal charges.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\"><strong>Library Activities:</strong> Library organizes various activities such as displays of books to celebrate national and international days, orientations, exhibitions of books, hosting film festivals, reading sessions, and guest lectures.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\"><strong>Reprographic Services:</strong> Printout, Scanning &amp; Photocopying services provided by the library.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\"><strong>Other Facilities:</strong> Library has CCTV, Interactive TV, Automatic Canon machine, Receipt Printers, Barcode Scanners, Printers &amp; Book Readers.</p>\n<p class=\"text-justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '1', 1, '', 0, 0, '2025-09-23 00:00:00'),
(85, 90, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, '', '<p><strong>lorem Ipsum</strong>&nbsp;is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged. It was popularised in the 1960s with the release of Letraset sheets containing Lorem Ipsum passages, and more recently with desktop publishing software like Aldus PageMaker including versions o</p>', '1', 1, '', 0, 0, '2025-09-23 00:00:00'),
