(517, 1, 20, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '<div class=\"container p-0\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<div class=\"mb-3 \">\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Department of Commerce (Accountancy &amp; Finance) is committed to providing quality education that combines strong theoretical knowledge with practical exposure, preparing students for the dynamic business and financial environment. The department emphasizes experiential learning, industry interaction, professional skill development, and entrepreneurial growth.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A key feature is the mandatory internship program in Semesters V and VI, where students gain hands-on experience with CA firms, banks, financial institutions, and corporate organizations. These internships expose students to real-world practices in accounting, taxation, auditing, financial reporting, and compliance while also developing professional skills such as communication, documentation, and time management.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The department regularly organizes industrial visits to institutions such as the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE), National Stock Exchange (NSE), Chartered Accountant firms, and corporate finance departments, helping students understand the functioning of India&rsquo;s financial markets.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To enhance professional competence, the department conducts guest lectures, financial awareness programs, and add-on certification courses in areas such as Research Methodology, Advanced Excel, GST, and Power BI. Sessions on competitive exams like CA, CMA, CS, CFA, and banking exams are also arranged.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entrepreneurial skills are fostered through the annual fest &ldquo;BIZZBASH&rdquo;, where students run real business ventures. Through academic fests &ldquo;BIZZ FIESTA&rdquo;, the department encourages creativity, leadership, and innovative skills among the students. Additionally, MoUs with organizations like Ilika Foundations, Seth Investments, and Vensiva Financial Services provide internships, training, and placement opportunities, strengthening industry-academia collaboration.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '1', 1, '', 0, 2, '2026-03-24 00:00:00'),
