(1383, 1, 23, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The B.Sc. / B.Sc. (Honours) in Cyber Security &amp; Digital Forensics is a future-focused undergraduate programme designed to prepare students for the rapidly evolving domain of digital security and cyber investigations. Aligned with NEP 2020, the programme offers a <strong>three-year B.Sc. pathway with an option to pursue a fourth year leading to B.Sc. (Honours)</strong>, enabling advanced specialization and research orientation.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The curriculum blends core computing knowledge with specialised training in cyber security, network systems, cryptography, and digital forensics. With a strong emphasis on real-world application, students develop the ability to understand, prevent, and investigate cyber threats in an increasingly digital world.</p>', '1', 1, '', 0, 2, '2026-05-23 00:00:00'),
