(1392, 1, 24, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The B.Sc. / B.Sc. (Honours) in Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning is a dynamic undergraduate programme designed to equip students with the knowledge and skills required to build intelligent systems and data-driven solutions. Structured as per NEP 2020, the programme offers a <strong>three-year B.Sc. degree with an option for a fourth year (Honours)</strong>&nbsp;focused on advanced learning and research.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The curriculum integrates computing, mathematics, and data science with core AI and machine learning techniques, preparing students to work at the forefront of intelligent technologies shaping the future.</p>', '1', 1, '', 0, 2, '2026-05-23 00:00:00'),
