(1401, 1, 25, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The B.Sc. / B.Sc. (Honours) in Data Science &amp; Data Analytics is an industry-relevant undergraduate programme designed to develop expertise in data analysis, statistical modelling, and data-driven decision-making. Aligned with NEP 2020, the programme offers a <strong>three-year B.Sc. degree with an option to pursue a fourth year (Honours)</strong>&nbsp;for advanced specialization and research.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The curriculum integrates programming, statistics, and analytical techniques to enable students to transform data into actionable insights across diverse domains.</p>', '1', 1, '', 0, 2, '2026-05-23 00:00:00'),
