(1410, 1, 26, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The B.Com. in International Accounting is a forward-looking undergraduate programme designed to prepare students for the evolving landscape of global finance and accounting. Aligned with NEP 2020, the programme develops a strong foundation in accounting and financial management while integrating international standards and global business perspectives.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">With a curriculum that blends core accounting principles with exposure to international financial reporting and cross-border practices, the programme equips students with the analytical insight and professional competence required in today&rsquo;s interconnected financial environment.</p>', '1', 1, '', 0, 2, '2026-05-23 00:00:00'),
