(1419, 1, 27, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The B.Com. in Digital Marketing with AI is a contemporary undergraduate programme designed to prepare students for the rapidly evolving digital economy. Aligned with NEP 2020, the programme integrates core commerce knowledge with modern marketing strategies, digital platforms, and artificial intelligence-driven tools.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The curriculum combines business fundamentals with practical expertise in digital marketing, analytics, and AI-enabled decision-making, equipping students to understand consumer behavior, optimize campaigns, and drive business growth in a technology-driven environment.</p>', '1', 1, '', 0, 2, '2026-05-23 00:00:00'),
