(1428, 1, 28, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The B.Sc. / B.Sc. (Honours) in Psychology is an undergraduate programme designed to provide a scientific and analytical understanding of human behavior and mental processes. Aligned with NEP 2020, the programme is offered as a <strong>three-year B.Sc. degree with an option to pursue a fourth year leading to B.Sc. (Honours)</strong>, enabling advanced academic and research-oriented learning.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The curriculum builds a strong foundation in psychological theories, research methodology, and statistics, along with practical exposure to experimentation and assessment techniques. It emphasizes an evidence-based approach to understanding behavior across cognitive, social, and developmental domains.</p>', '1', 1, '', 0, 2, '2026-05-23 00:00:00'),
