(1437, 1, 29, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The M.Sc. in Clinical Psychology is a two-year postgraduate programme designed to develop advanced understanding of psychological assessment, mental health, and evidence-based therapeutic approaches. Aligned with NEP 2020, the programme integrates theoretical knowledge with structured practical training, enabling students to work effectively in clinical and applied settings under appropriate professional frameworks.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The curriculum covers core areas such as psychopathology, psychological assessment, psychotherapy, counselling techniques, and research methodology, with a strong focus on developing analytical, diagnostic, and intervention skills.</p>', '1', 1, '', 0, 2, '2026-06-23 02:39:08'),
