(24, '2026-2027', 'Harshita Purohit', '8369745378', 'purohitharshita06@gmail.com', 0, '2026-04-22 00:00:00', 0, 'Bachelor of Arts (B.A)', 'I have completed my First Year (FY) and Second Year (SY) under the NEP pattern from S.K. Somaiya College. I am interested in taking admission to Third Year (TY) BA Psychology in your college. I would like to know the eligibility criteria, admission process, and any requirements or documents needed for transfer. Kindly let me know if there is anything else I should be aware of. Thankyou.', '2026-04-22 04:42:04'),
