(44, '2026-2027', 'Purvi Prajapati', '9167643403', 'purvism97@gmail.com', 0, '2026-04-28 00:00:00', 0, 'Master of Arts (M.A)', 'I have a keen interest in applying for your MA counselling psychology program. I completed by B.A liberal arts (psychology minor) in the year 2021. \nI then moved to complete with fellowship with a non profit organization that worked on mental health of students in BMC schools using the Social Emotional Learning curriculum. \nI also did my P.G diploma in Yoga Education from Kaivalyadham Institute. Currently I am a practicing yoga therapist and use counselling as a skill to work with a diverse set of people. I wish to deepen my knowledge and skills sets to be enable people to live up to their fullest potential. Looking forward to learning from your esteemed organization.', '2026-04-28 05:08:16'),
