(251, '2026-2027', 'Himadri Singh', '8767821830', 'himadari95@gmail.com', 0, '2026-05-22 00:00:00', 0, 'Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.)', '&#34;The human mind is the most complex system in existence — and that complexity is what draws me to Psychology. I want to pursue B.Sc. Psychology to move beyond surface-level understanding and study behaviour, cognition, and emotion with scientific depth. My goal is to eventually contribute to mental health awareness in a country where it is still widely misunderstood, and this program is the foundation I need to get there.&#34; Also, because I believe understanding the human mind is one of the most powerful tools a person can have. In a world dealing with rising mental health challenges, trained professionals who genuinely care are needed more than ever. This program is my first step toward becoming one of them. Thank you.', '2026-05-22 14:39:46'),
